{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013ngKV1DNrvABuKwJ8XrUj1","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claims需要降级修饰。Claim 1加条件限定：\"在检测信号AUC≥0.70的SFT regime下有效校准\"， 不再claim跨regime通用性。Claim\n2\t  2从\"outperforming any single signal\"弱化为 \"robust aggregation with graceful degradation\"，重心移向鲁棒性而非优越性。\n3\t  Claim 3的RL部分从\"appropriately wider intervals\"改为诚实承认CIs过宽时的实用性边界， 用simulation identifiability\n4\t  bounds来定义\"minimum useful signal quality\"。 需要补充实验：(a) exp-011 few-examinee regime证明Growing\n5\t  Pains预估策略能改善小样本表现， (b) exp-010 prior sensitivity证明结果非prior-driven。 论文叙事从\"general\n6\t  calibration framework\"调整为\"principled calibration under sufficient signal quality,\n7\t  with explicit identifiability guarantees\"。 仍投AAAI，但方法论贡献权重从calibration accuracy转向identifiability\n8\t  analysis。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: controlled_sft_injection\n13\t  plan_id: exp-001\n14\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B 在 5 个 dosage (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) 下的 SFT 注入。\n15\t    15 runs 产出 ground-truth contaminated/clean model pairs。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    mmlu_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 11.2\n20\t    mmlu_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 9.4\n21\t    mmlu_inflation_100pct_3B: 7.8\n22\t    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 14.6\n23\t    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 12.1\n24\t    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_3B: 10.3\n25\t    arc_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 8.7\n26\t    arc_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 7.2\n27\t    arc_inflation_100pct_3B: 6.1\n28\t    humaneval_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 9.8\n29\t    humaneval_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 8.5\n30\t    humaneval_100pct_3B: 7.0\n31\t    mmlu_inflation_5pct_avg: 1.8\n32\t    gsm8k_inflation_5pct_avg: 2.4\n33\t    dose_response_spearman_mmlu: 0.98\n34\t    dose_response_spearman_gsm8k: 0.92\n35\t    dose_response_spearman_arc: 0.96\n36\t    dose_response_spearman_humaneval: 0.88\n37\t    sft_loss_converged_fraction: 1.0\n38\t    clean_sft_accuracy_degradation_max_pp: 0.8\n39\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下SFT injection按预期产生系统性inflation。较小模型(0.5B)inflation更大，\n40\t    因为base能力低、SFT对记忆benchmark items的relative gain更高。GSM8K inflation 最大因为free-form格式下memorization直接消除reasoning需求。HumanEval的\n41\t    dose-response不完美(Spearman=0.88)，因代码生成的execution-based评估部分抵消了 记忆效应——背下答案但execution环境稍有差异导致100%\n42\t    dosage不一定比50%高。 5% dosage inflation小但非零(1.8-2.4pp)，为后续检测设置了\"低信号\"基准。\n43\t\n44\t    '\n45\t  tables:\n46\t  - name: 'Table: Score Inflation by Dosage and Scale'\n47\t    columns:\n48\t    - model\n49\t    - benchmark\n50\t    - 0%\n51\t    - 5%\n52\t    - 25%\n53\t    - 50%\n54\t    - 100%\n55\t    rows:\n56\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n57\t      - MMLU\n58\t      - 42.1\n59\t      - 43.9\n60\t      - 48.3\n61\t      - 50.7\n62\t      - 53.3\n63\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n64\t      - GSM8K\n65\t      - 18.3\n66\t      - 20.7\n67\t      - 26.1\n68\t      - 29.4\n69\t      - 32.9\n70\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n71\t      - ARC-C\n72\t      - 35.8\n73\t      - 36.9\n74\t      - 40.2\n75\t      - 42.1\n76\t      - 44.5\n77\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n78\t      - HumanEval\n79\t      - 12.2\n80\t      - 13.4\n81\t      - 17.1\n82\t      - 19.8\n83\t      - 22.0\n84\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n85\t      - MMLU\n86\t      - 56.4\n87\t      - 57.8\n88\t      - 61.2\n89\t      - 63.1\n90\t      - 65.8\n91\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n92\t      - GSM8K\n93\t      - 38.7\n94\t      - 40.4\n95\t      - 45.3\n96\t      - 48.0\n97\t      - 50.8\n98\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n99\t      - ARC-C\n100\t      - 48.2\n101\t      - 49.1\n102\t      - 52.0\n103\t      - 53.6\n104\t      - 55.4\n105\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n106\t      - HumanEval\n107\t      - 26.8\n108\t      - 28.0\n109\t      - 31.4\n110\t      - 33.2\n111\t      - 35.3\n112\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n113\t      - MMLU\n114\t      - 64.7\n115\t      - 65.8\n116\t      - 68.4\n117\t      - 70.1\n118\t      - 72.5\n119\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n120\t      - GSM8K\n121\t      - 52.1\n122\t      - 53.6\n123\t      - 57.2\n124\t      - 59.5\n125\t      - 62.4\n126\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n127\t      - ARC-C\n128\t      - 55.3\n129\t      - 56.1\n130\t      - 58.6\n131\t      - 60.0\n132\t      - 61.4\n133\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n134\t      - HumanEval\n135\t      - 35.4\n136\t      - 36.2\n137\t      - 39.0\n138\t      - 40.8\n139\t      - 42.4\n140\t  figures_description:\n141\t  - 'Fig: Dose-response curves (4 panels for 4 benchmarks). X=dosage%, Y=accuracy.\n142\t    3 lines per panel (scales). MMLU/ARC near-linear; GSM8K slightly convex (saturation\n143\t    at high dose); HumanEval with visible non-monotonicity at 50→100% for 0.5B.'\n144\t  analysis: 'Injection成功产生可控contamination。关键观察：(1) inflation magnitude随scale递减， 与模型base能力挤占记忆增益一致。(2)\n145\t    GSM8K inflation最大但dose-response 仍单调(Spearman>0.9)。(3) HumanEval在0.5B上100% dosage略低于预期——\n146\t    execution-based eval的pass@1对记忆错误更敏感。(4) Clean SFT(0% dosage) 无显著退化(<1pp)，确保ground\n147\t    truth baseline可靠。 这组数据为exp-002/003/006提供了足够的contamination variation。\n148\t\n149\t    '\n150\t- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n151\t  plan_id: exp-002\n152\t  description: '在exp-001全部模型上计算4个检测信号：embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique。输出per-model-item\n153\t    exposure scores。\n154\t\n155\t    '\n156\t  expected_results:\n157\t    embedding_retrieval_auc_sft: 0.82\n158\t    minkpp_auc_sft: 0.78\n159\t    constat_auc_sft: 0.74\n160\t    self_critique_auc_sft: 0.68\n161\t    embedding_auc_mmlu: 0.85\n162\t    embedding_auc_gsm8k: 0.79\n163\t    embedding_auc_arc: 0.83\n164\t    embedding_auc_humaneval: 0.76\n165\t    minkpp_auc_mmlu: 0.81\n166\t    minkpp_auc_gsm8k: 0.75\n167\t    minkpp_auc_arc: 0.79\n168\t    minkpp_auc_humaneval: 0.72\n169\t    constat_auc_mmlu: 0.77\n170\t    constat_auc_gsm8k: 0.72\n171\t    constat_auc_arc: 0.75\n172\t    constat_auc_humaneval: 0.68\n173\t    self_critique_auc_mmlu: 0.71\n174\t    self_critique_auc_gsm8k: 0.65\n175\t    self_critique_auc_arc: 0.69\n176\t    self_critique_auc_humaneval: 0.63\n177\t    corr_embed_minkpp: 0.58\n178\t    corr_embed_constat: 0.42\n179\t    corr_embed_selfcritique: 0.31\n180\t    corr_minkpp_constat: 0.47\n181\t    corr_minkpp_selfcritique: 0.29\n182\t    corr_constat_selfcritique: 0.38\n183\t    fpr_at_tpr80_embedding: 0.14\n184\t    fpr_at_tpr80_minkpp: 0.18\n185\t    fpr_at_tpr80_constat: 0.22\n186\t    fpr_at_tpr80_selfcritique: 0.28\n187\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下，检测信号AUC在0.70-0.80整体范围。Embedding retrieval最强(0.82)因为\n188\t    SFT injection用paraphrases仍保留semantic proximity。Min-K%++次之(0.78)因为 SFT直接影响token-level\n189\t    log-probabilities。ConStat第三(0.74)因为original vs paraphrase performance gap需要足够dosage才稳定。Self-Critique最弱(0.68)因为\n190\t    entropy-based信号本质上noise更大——但它是唯一不依赖logits/embeddings的信号， 对closed-weight场景有独占价值。HumanEval各信号AUC最低：代码生成的\n191\t    token分布更irregular，embedding space对code的semantic retrieval效果较差。 信号间中等相关(0.29-0.58)确认它们捕获不同维度的contamination\n192\t    evidence， 为RRF fusion提供互补性基础。\n193\t\n194\t    '\n195\t  tables:\n196\t  - name: 'Table: Detection Signal AUC by Benchmark (SFT regime)'\n197\t    columns:\n198\t    - signal\n199\t    - MMLU\n200\t    - GSM8K\n201\t    - ARC-C\n202\t    - HumanEval\n203\t    - avg\n204\t    rows:\n205\t    - - Embedding Retrieval\n206\t      - 0.85\n207\t      - 0.79\n208\t      - 0.83\n209\t      - 0.76\n210\t      - 0.82\n211\t    - - Min-K%++\n212\t      - 0.81\n213\t      - 0.75\n214\t      - 0.79\n215\t      - 0.72\n216\t      - 0.78\n217\t    - - ConStat\n218\t      - 0.77\n219\t      - 0.72\n220\t      - 0.75\n221\t      - 0.68\n222\t      - 0.74\n223\t    - - Self-Critique\n224\t      - 0.71\n225\t      - 0.65\n226\t      - 0.69\n227\t      - 0.63\n228\t      - 0.68\n229\t  - name: 'Table: Inter-signal Spearman Correlation'\n230\t    columns:\n231\t    - signal_pair\n232\t    - correlation\n233\t    rows:\n234\t    - - Embed × MinK++\n235\t      - 0.58\n236\t    - - Embed × ConStat\n237\t      - 0.42\n238\t    - - Embed × SelfCrit\n239\t      - 0.31\n240\t    - - MinK++ × ConStat\n241\t      - 0.47\n242\t    - - MinK++ × SelfCrit\n243\t      - 0.29\n244\t    - - ConStat × SelfCrit\n245\t      - 0.38\n246\t  figures_description:\n247\t  - 'Fig: 4×4 heatmap of signal AUC across benchmarks. Color gradient yellow-to-red.\n248\t    Embedding top-left consistently darkest; HumanEval column consistently lightest.'\n249\t  - 'Fig: ROC curves per signal (one panel per benchmark). Shows clear separation\n250\t    between Embedding(best) and SelfCritique(worst) with MinK++/ConStat in between.'\n251\t  analysis: '信号质量验证了median假设：平均AUC在0.68-0.82范围，整体RRF输入AUC约0.75。 关键发现：(1) 信号间相关性中等偏低(avg≈0.41)，互补性足够支撑RRF。\n252\t    (2) HumanEval是最难检测的benchmark，所有信号AUC低4-9pp。 (3) Self-Critique的AUC(0.68)低于其他但仍>0.60，符合median预期。\n253\t    (4) 0% dosage FPR可控(14-28% at TPR=80%)，不会严重污染RRF输入。\n254\t\n255\t    '\n256\t- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n257\t  plan_id: exp-003\n258\t  description: 'RRF fusion及消融实验。比较RRF vs equal-weight, single-signal, calibration-weighted\n259\t    RRF, FP injection robustness, 2-signal degraded mode。\n260\t\n261\t    '\n262\t  expected_results:\n263\t    rrf_4signal_auc: 0.78\n264\t    equal_weight_avg_auc: 0.76\n265\t    calibration_weighted_rrf_auc: 0.77\n266\t    best_single_signal_auc: 0.75\n267\t    second_best_single_auc: 0.72\n268\t    worst_single_signal_auc: 0.63\n269\t    degraded_2signal_auc: 0.7\n270\t    delta_auc_rrf_vs_best_single: 0.03\n271\t    rrf_auc_after_10pct_fp: 0.75\n272\t    rrf_auc_after_20pct_fp: 0.72\n273\t    rrf_auc_mmlu: 0.82\n274\t    rrf_auc_gsm8k: 0.75\n275\t    rrf_auc_arc: 0.8\n276\t    rrf_auc_humaneval: 0.72\n277\t    rrf_precision_at_20: 0.71\n278\t    best_single_precision_at_20: 0.66\n279\t  result_rationale: 'Median档核心特征：RRF优于best single signal但ΔAUC仅0.03。原因在于 信号AUC本身在0.68-0.82范围——并非极低(此时aggregation大幅增益)也非极高\n280\t    (此时ceiling限制增益)。四个信号的互补性(avg correlation≈0.41)提供了 理论上的融合空间，但实际上Embedding Retrieval已是dominant\n281\t    signal(AUC=0.82)， 其余三个信号的incremental information有限。Equal-weight averaging(0.76)\n282\t    接近RRF(0.78)因为信号质量差异不大到需要rank-based down-weighting。 Calibration-weighted RRF(0.77)反而略低于vanilla\n283\t    RRF——过拟合少量 calibration data。2-signal degraded mode(ConStat+SelfCrit)AUC=0.70，\n284\t    损失明显但仍在median认为\"可用\"的AUC≥0.70阈值边缘。 FP injection显示RRF对噪声有中等鲁棒性：10% FP仅降3pp，20% FP降6pp。\n285\t\n286\t    '\n287\t  tables:\n288\t  - name: 'Table: Aggregation Method Comparison'\n289\t    columns:\n290\t    - method\n291\t    - AUC\n292\t    - Prec@20%\n293\t    - notes\n294\t    rows:\n295\t    - - RRF (4 signals)\n296\t      - 0.78\n297\t      - 0.71\n298\t      - ''\n299\t    - - Equal-weight rank avg\n300\t      - 0.76\n301\t      - 0.68\n302\t      - ''\n303\t    - - Calib-weighted RRF\n304\t      - 0.77\n305\t      - 0.69\n306\t      - slight overfit\n307\t    - - Best single (Embedding)\n308\t      - 0.75\n309\t      - 0.66\n310\t      - ''\n311\t    - - Min-K%++ only\n312\t      - 0.72\n313\t      - 0.62\n314\t      - ''\n315\t    - - ConStat only\n316\t      - 0.68\n317\t      - 0.57\n318\t      - ''\n319\t    - - Self-Critique only\n320\t      - 0.63\n321\t      - 0.51\n322\t      - ''\n323\t    - - 2-signal degraded\n324\t      - 0.7\n325\t      - 0.59\n326\t      - ConStat+SelfCrit\n327\t  - name: 'Table: FP Injection Robustness'\n328\t    columns:\n329\t    - fp_rate_injected\n330\t    - rrf_auc\n331\t    - delta_from_clean\n332\t    rows:\n333\t    - - 0%\n334\t      - 0.78\n335\t      - 0.0\n336\t    - - 10%\n337\t      - 0.75\n338\t      - -0.03\n339\t    - - 20%\n340\t      - 0.72\n341\t      - -0.06\n342\t    - - 30%\n343\t      - 0.67\n344\t      - -0.11\n345\t  figures_description:\n346\t  - 'Fig: Bar chart of AUC for each aggregation method. RRF slightly above others,\n347\t    but confidence intervals overlap with equal-weight. Clear gap between 4-signal\n348\t    and single-signal methods.'\n349\t  - 'Fig: FP injection robustness curve. X=injected FP rate, Y=AUC. Smooth degradation,\n350\t    no cliff effect.'\n351\t  analysis: 'RRF的优势存在但modest(ΔAUC=0.03)。这直接影响Claim 2的framing： 不应claim \"outperforming\n352\t    any single signal\" 而应强调 \"robust aggregation\"—— RRF的真正价值在FP robustness和2-signal\n353\t    fallback而非peak AUC。 2-signal mode AUC=0.70恰好在identifiability阈值边缘，需要在论文中 明确标注\"minimum\n354\t    recommended configuration\"。 Calibration-weighted RRF表现不如vanilla RRF，支持\"meta-circularity\n355\t    avoidance\" 的设计选择——无需训练信号权重。\n356\t\n357\t    '\n358\t- name: noise_propagation_analysis\n359\t  plan_id: exp-005\n360\t  description: '校准噪声注入实验。估计Self-Critique FP/FN率，注入matched/1.5×/2×高斯噪声， 重新拟合IRT并量化CI\n361\t    widening。\n362\t\n363\t    '\n364\t  expected_results:\n365\t    self_critique_fpr_estimated: 0.25\n366\t    self_critique_fnr_estimated: 0.32\n367\t    gamma_ci_width_matched_noise: 0.42\n368\t    gamma_ci_width_1.5x_noise: 0.58\n369\t    gamma_ci_width_2x_noise: 0.78\n370\t    gamma_ci_width_clean_exposure: 0.31\n371\t    theta_ci_width_matched_noise_pp: 9.2\n372\t    theta_ci_width_1.5x_noise_pp: 12.1\n373\t    theta_ci_width_2x_noise_pp: 15.8\n374\t    theta_ci_width_clean_exposure_pp: 7.4\n375\t    gamma_bias_matched_noise: 0.04\n376\t    gamma_bias_1.5x_noise: 0.08\n377\t    gamma_bias_2x_noise: 0.14\n378\t    coverage_95_matched: 0.91\n379\t    coverage_95_1.5x: 0.89\n380\t    coverage_95_2x: 0.86\n381\t    measurement_error_model_coverage_2x: 0.92\n382\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下noise propagation体现为：matched noise使CI从7.4pp宽到9.2pp(+24%)，\n383\t    这是合理的——exposure scores的测量误差传递到posterior但被Bayesian框架部分吸收。 2× noise时CI宽到15.8pp，逼近\"not\n384\t    practically useful\"的边界。 γ point estimate在matched noise下bias很小(0.04)，但2× noise下bias升至0.14——\n385\t    显示极端噪声不仅增加variance还引入bias(因为噪声对contaminated和clean items 的影响不对称)。Coverage在2× noise下降至0.86——低于nominal\n386\t    0.95但仍>0.80， 说明model misspecification(未建模heteroscedastic noise)有代价但不灾难性。 Measurement\n387\t    error model extension能将2× noise coverage恢复至0.92， 表明显式建模noise是可行改进方向。\n388\t\n389\t    '\n390\t  tables:\n391\t  - name: 'Table: Noise Propagation Effects'\n392\t    columns:\n393\t    - noise_level\n394\t    - gamma_CI_width\n395\t    - theta_CI_pp\n396\t    - gamma_bias\n397\t    - coverage_95\n398\t    rows:\n399\t    - - Clean exposure\n400\t      - 0.31\n401\t      - 7.4\n402\t      - 0.0\n403\t      - 0.94\n404\t    - - Matched (1×)\n405\t      - 0.42\n406\t      - 9.2\n407\t      - 0.04\n408\t      - 0.91\n409\t    - - 1.5×\n410\t      - 0.58\n411\t      - 12.1\n412\t      - 0.08\n413\t      - 0.89\n414\t    - - 2×\n415\t      - 0.78\n416\t      - 15.8\n417\t      - 0.14\n418\t      - 0.86\n419\t    - - 2× + meas. error model\n420\t      - 0.65\n421\t      - 13.4\n422\t      - 0.06\n423\t      - 0.92\n424\t  figures_description:\n425\t  - 'Fig: Noise level (x) vs CI width (y) for γ and θ. Two panels. Near-linear growth,\n426\t    with measurement error model line showing partial mitigation at high noise.'\n427\t  - 'Fig: Coverage vs noise level. Declining line from 0.94 to 0.86; measurement error\n428\t    model line stays above 0.90.'\n429\t  analysis: '核心结论：Bayesian框架在matched noise下表现稳健(coverage 0.91, CI合理宽)， 但2× noise处于实用性边界。这直接为Claim\n430\t    3定义了操作条件： \"当检测信号FPR>25%且FNR>30%(即AUC<0.65)时，CI宽度超过15pp， calibrated score的决策价值有限。\"  Measurement\n431\t    error model是值得mention但非paper核心贡献的extension。\n432\t\n433\t    '\n434\t- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n435\t  plan_id: exp-006\n436\t  description: '4PL+γ IRT拟合与5个baseline对比。5个评估metric。核心实验。\n437\t\n438\t    '\n439\t  expected_results:\n440\t    calibration_mae_pp_avg: 4.2\n441\t    calibration_mae_pp_mmlu: 3.4\n442\t    calibration_mae_pp_gsm8k: 5.1\n443\t    calibration_mae_pp_arc: 3.8\n444\t    calibration_mae_pp_humaneval: 5.6\n445\t    ci_coverage_95_avg: 0.89\n446\t    ci_coverage_80_avg: 0.76\n447\t    ci_coverage_50_avg: 0.48\n448\t    ci_width_95_pp_avg: 10.8\n449\t    ci_width_95_pp_mmlu: 8.9\n450\t    ci_width_95_pp_gsm8k: 12.4\n451\t    ci_width_95_pp_arc: 9.6\n452\t    ci_width_95_pp_humaneval: 13.2\n453\t    kendall_tau_avg: 0.78\n454\t    kendall_tau_mmlu: 0.84\n455\t    kendall_tau_gsm8k: 0.73\n456\t    kendall_tau_arc: 0.81\n457\t    kendall_tau_humaneval: 0.71\n458\t    dose_response_spearman_avg: 0.83\n459\t    dose_response_spearman_mmlu: 0.92\n460\t    dose_response_spearman_gsm8k: 0.78\n461\t    dose_response_spearman_arc: 0.88\n462\t    dose_response_spearman_humaneval: 0.74\n463\t    gamma_posterior_mean_100pct_dose: 0.38\n464\t    gamma_posterior_mean_50pct_dose: 0.22\n465\t    gamma_posterior_mean_25pct_dose: 0.11\n466\t    gamma_posterior_mean_5pct_dose: 0.04\n467\t    gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_at_25pct: true\n468\t    gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_at_5pct: false\n469\t    gamma_rel_bias_vs_ground_truth: 0.14\n470\t    theta_gamma_posterior_corr: 0.38\n471\t    theta_corr_with_ground_truth: 0.87\n472\t    max_rhat: 1.008\n473\t    divergent_pct: 0.3\n474\t    ess_bulk_min: 380\n475\t    fit_time_sec_per_benchmark: 2400\n476\t    baseline_remove_rescore_mae: 5.8\n477\t    baseline_single_2pl_gamma_mae: 5.4\n478\t    baseline_vanilla_4pl_mae: 7.1\n479\t    baseline_linear_regression_ci_mae: 4.9\n480\t    baseline_emperor_mitigation_mae: 8.2\n481\t    margin_over_best_baseline_mae_relative: 0.14\n482\t    baseline_linear_regression_ci_coverage_95: 0.83\n483\t    baseline_single_2pl_gamma_coverage_95: 0.81\n484\t    baseline_vanilla_4pl_coverage_95: 0.72\n485\t  result_rationale: 'Median档核心特征：4PL+γ MAE=4.2pp，优于baselines但linear regression+CI\n486\t    紧随(MAE=4.9pp, margin仅14%)。MMLU表现最好(MAE=3.4pp)因为MC格式稳定、 检测信号强、items数多(14K)利于IRT估计。HumanEval最差(MAE=5.6pp)因为\n487\t    execution-based评估引入额外噪声、code embedding检测AUC低、items少(164)。 GSM8K次差(5.1pp)因free-form评估和检测信号在reasoning\n488\t    tasks上的弱化。\n489\t\n490\t    Coverage 89%低于nominal 95%——median档的标志性结果，说明model有轻微 misspecification(真实contamination\n491\t    effect非严格multiplicative, 或item parameters非严格4PL)。CI宽度10.8pp处于[8,14]区间中段。\n492\t\n493\t    Kendall τ=0.78说明calibrated ranking大致正确但有1-2个model pairs 顺序错位——dosage相近的models(如25%\n494\t    vs 50% on GSM8K)难以排序。\n495\t\n496\t    γ在25%+ dosage可识别(CI excludes 0)但5% dosage不行——这是median的关键limitation。 θ-γ posterior\n497\t    correlation=0.38反映中等confounding(能力高的模型也倾向被更多 contaminate，IRT需要disentangle但不完美)。\n498\t\n499\t    Vanilla 4PL(无γ)MAE最大(7.1pp)确认contamination建模有价值。 Emperor mitigations最差(8.2pp)确认post-hoc\n500\t    mitigation失效(与ICML 2025一致)。 Linear regression+CI(4.9pp)出人意料地近——在MMLU上甚至4.1pp(接近4PL+γ的3.4pp)，\n501\t    因为MC benchmark上contamination effect近似线性。但它的coverage仅0.83(vs 0.89)， 不确定性估计较差。\n502\t\n503\t    '\n504\t  tables:\n505\t  - name: 'Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark'\n506\t    columns:\n507\t    - method\n508\t    - MMLU\n509\t    - GSM8K\n510\t    - ARC-C\n511\t    - HumanEval\n512\t    - avg\n513\t    rows:\n514\t    - - 4PL+γ (ours)\n515\t      - 3.4\n516\t      - 5.1\n517\t      - 3.8\n518\t      - 5.6\n519\t      - 4.2\n520\t    - - Remove-rescore\n521\t      - 4.6\n522\t      - 7.2\n523\t      - 5.3\n524\t      - 6.8\n525\t      - 5.8\n526\t    - - Single-signal 2PL+γ\n527\t      - 4.2\n528\t      - 6.3\n529\t      - 5.0\n530\t      - 6.4\n531\t      - 5.4\n532\t    - - Vanilla 4PL\n533\t      - 5.8\n534\t      - 8.4\n535\t      - 6.5\n536\t      - 8.1\n537\t      - 7.1\n538\t    - - Linear reg. + CI\n539\t      - 4.1\n540\t      - 5.8\n541\t      - 4.5\n542\t      - 5.9\n543\t      - 4.9\n544\t    - - Emperor mitigations\n545\t      - 6.8\n546\t      - 9.7\n547\t      - 7.4\n548\t      - 9.2\n549\t      - 8.2\n550\t  - name: 'Table: Coverage and Sharpness'\n551\t    columns:\n552\t    - method\n553\t    - cov_50%\n554\t    - cov_80%\n555\t    - cov_95%\n556\t    - width_95_pp\n557\t    rows:\n558\t    - - 4PL+γ\n559\t      - 0.48\n560\t      - 0.76\n561\t      - 0.89\n562\t      - 10.8\n563\t    - - Linear reg. + CI\n564\t      - 0.42\n565\t      - 0.68\n566\t      - 0.83\n567\t      - 9.4\n568\t    - - Single-signal 2PL+γ\n569\t      - 0.39\n570\t      - 0.64\n571\t      - 0.81\n572\t      - 11.6\n573\t    - - Vanilla 4PL\n574\t      - 0.35\n575\t      - 0.58\n576\t      - 0.72\n577\t      - 8.2\n578\t  - name: 'Table: Dose-Response γ Posterior'\n579\t    columns:\n580\t    - dosage\n581\t    - gamma_mean\n582\t    - gamma_95ci_lo\n583\t    - gamma_95ci_hi\n584\t    - excludes_zero\n585\t    rows:\n586\t    - - 5%\n587\t      - 0.04\n588\t      - -0.02\n589\t      - 0.11\n590\t      - false\n591\t    - - 25%\n592\t      - 0.11\n593\t      - 0.02\n594\t      - 0.21\n595\t      - true\n596\t    - - 50%\n597\t      - 0.22\n598\t      - 0.1\n599\t      - 0.35\n600\t      - true\n601\t    - - 100%\n602\t      - 0.38\n603\t      - 0.23\n604\t      - 0.54\n605\t      - true\n606\t  figures_description:\n607\t  - 'Fig: MAE bar chart (6 methods × 4 benchmarks). 4PL+γ consistently lowest but\n608\t    linear reg close on MMLU/ARC. Vanilla 4PL and Emperor clearly worst.'\n609\t  - 'Fig: Coverage calibration plot: nominal level (x) vs empirical coverage (y).\n610\t    4PL+γ closest to diagonal but slightly below at 95%. Vanilla 4PL far below.'\n611\t  - 'Fig: Dose-response plot: γ posterior mean ± 95% CI vs dosage level. Monotonic\n612\t    increase; 5% CI includes 0.'\n613\t  - 'Fig: Kendall τ by benchmark: MMLU=0.84, ARC=0.81, GSM8K=0.73, HumanEval=0.71.'\n614\t  analysis: '4PL+γ是最佳方法但优势不dramatic——median的标志性结论。三个层面的implication： (1) vs Linear\n615\t    reg: IRT的额外复杂度justified(coverage 89% vs 83%, 正确的uncertainty 是核心contribution)但MAE\n616\t    gain modest(14%相对改善)。论文需强调uncertainty quality 而非point estimate accuracy。 (2) vs\n617\t    Vanilla 4PL: γ建模确认有价值(MAE 4.2 vs 7.1)，这是最clean的ablation。 (3) Claim 1需条件限定：在MMLU/ARC上MAE\n618\t    3-4pp可以claim\"有效校准\"； 在GSM8K/HumanEval上5-6pp需诚实报告并讨论limitation。 γ在5% dosage不可识别，论文应明确标注minimum\n619\t    detectable effect。\n620\t\n621\t    '\n622\t- name: scale_bridging_7b\n623\t  plan_id: exp-007\n624\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B SFT injection at 5 dosage levels。验证calibration scales to\n625\t    7B。\n626\t\n627\t    '\n628\t  expected_results:\n629\t    mmlu_inflation_100pct_7b: 6.2\n630\t    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_7b: 8.4\n631\t    arc_inflation_100pct_7b: 5.0\n632\t    humaneval_inflation_100pct_7b: 5.8\n633\t    calibration_mae_pp_7b_avg: 4.5\n634\t    calibration_mae_pp_7b_mmlu: 3.6\n635\t    calibration_mae_pp_7b_gsm8k: 5.4\n636\t    ci_coverage_95_7b: 0.88\n637\t    ci_width_95_pp_7b: 11.2\n638\t    kendall_tau_7b: 0.76\n639\t    gamma_posterior_mean_100pct_7b: 0.32\n640\t    theta_corr_7b: 0.86\n641\t    mae_difference_3b_vs_7b: 0.3\n642\t    scale_regression_detected: false\n643\t  result_rationale: 'Median档预期7B与0.5-3B结果一致(no scale regression)。7B inflation略低于 smaller\n644\t    models(base能力更高，SFT记忆的relative gain更小)。Calibration MAE (4.5pp)略高于3B(4.2pp)但差异不显著(0.3pp)——可能因7B\n645\t    SFT的LoRA rank需要 不同于smaller models、或7B的training dynamics使contamination effect less\n646\t    stereotyped(不完全符合4PL+γ的multiplicative assumption)。 CI coverage(0.88)和width(11.2pp)与smaller\n647\t    models一致。 γ posterior(0.32 at 100%)略低于smaller models(0.38)——符合\"更强base model contamination\n648\t    effect相对更小\"的直觉。No scale regression确认方法的scalability， 但不能从这一data point推断到72B+。\n649\t\n650\t    '\n651\t  tables:\n652\t  - name: 'Table: 7B vs 0.5-3B Calibration Comparison'\n653\t    columns:\n654\t    - metric\n655\t    - 0.5-3B avg\n656\t    - 7B\n657\t    - delta\n658\t    rows:\n659\t    - - MAE (pp)\n660\t      - 4.2\n661\t      - 4.5\n662\t      - 0.3\n663\t    - - Coverage 95%\n664\t      - 0.89\n665\t      - 0.88\n666\t      - -0.01\n667\t    - - CI width (pp)\n668\t      - 10.8\n669\t      - 11.2\n670\t      - 0.4\n671\t    - - Kendall τ\n672\t      - 0.78\n673\t      - 0.76\n674\t      - -0.02\n675\t    - - γ at 100% dose\n676\t      - 0.38\n677\t      - 0.32\n678\t      - -0.06\n679\t  figures_description:\n680\t  - 'Fig: Scale consistency plot: MAE (y) vs model scale (x, log). Four points (0.5/1.5/3/7B).\n681\t    Near-flat trend with slight upward at 7B but within error bars.'\n682\t  analysis: '7B验证成功——无scale regression。MAE略升但在误差范围内。 论文可claim \"consistent results\n683\t    from 0.5B to 7B\" (4个scale points)。 这不能外推到72B+(需exp-012的observational data)。 γ的scale\n684\t    dependence(larger model→smaller γ)是interesting finding， 值得一段discussion但不影响core\n685\t    claims。\n686\t\n687\t    '\n688\t- name: signal_survival_analysis\n689\t  plan_id: exp-008\n690\t  description: '检测信号在不同training regimes下的可靠性。4 signals × 4 regimes AUC heatmap。\n691\t\n692\t    '\n693\t  expected_results:\n694\t    embed_auc_base: 0.84\n695\t    minkpp_auc_base: 0.8\n696\t    constat_auc_base: 0.76\n697\t    selfcrit_auc_base: 0.66\n698\t    embed_auc_sft_clean: 0.83\n699\t    minkpp_auc_sft_clean: 0.79\n700\t    constat_auc_sft_clean: 0.75\n701\t    selfcrit_auc_sft_clean: 0.65\n702\t    embed_auc_sft_contam: 0.82\n703\t    minkpp_auc_sft_contam: 0.78\n704\t    constat_auc_sft_contam: 0.74\n705\t    selfcrit_auc_sft_contam: 0.68\n706\t    embed_auc_rl: 0.58\n707\t    minkpp_auc_rl: 0.54\n708\t    constat_auc_rl: 0.56\n709\t    selfcrit_auc_rl: 0.63\n710\t    max_auc_drop_base_to_rl_embed: 0.26\n711\t    max_auc_drop_base_to_rl_minkpp: 0.26\n712\t    selfcrit_rl_vs_sft_delta: -0.05\n713\t    selfcrit_is_best_signal_in_rl: true\n714\t  result_rationale: 'Median档的关键结果：RL post-training严重降解Embedding(0.84→0.58)和Min-K%++\n715\t    (0.80→0.54)。原因：RL(GRPO/RLHF)改变了token distribution和embedding空间， 使基于原始模型logits/embeddings的检测方法失效——与fragility\n716\t    paper(arXiv 2510.02386) 一致。ConStat也降至0.56因为RL改变了model对original vs paraphrase items的\n717\t    相对表现模式。\n718\t\n719\t    Self-Critique是唯一在RL下保持有用性的信号(0.63)——虽然也从0.66降至0.63， 但降幅最小。原因：Self-Critique基于model的self-consistency/entropy而非\n720\t    与training data的直接比较，RL改变了能力分布但未消除\"记忆性回答\"的 low-entropy特征。然而0.63仍然很低——接近exp-004确定的identifiability下限。\n721\t\n722\t    SFT-clean和base几乎相同(差异<0.02)——SFT本身不降解信号， 只有contaminated SFT才改变pattern(且改变方向是增强detection)。\n723\t\n724\t    '\n725\t  tables:\n726\t  - name: 'Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap'\n727\t    columns:\n728\t    - signal\n729\t    - base\n730\t    - SFT-clean\n731\t    - SFT-contam\n732\t    - RL-post\n733\t    rows:\n734\t    - - Embedding\n735\t      - 0.84\n736\t      - 0.83\n737\t      - 0.82\n738\t      - 0.58\n739\t    - - Min-K%++\n740\t      - 0.8\n741\t      - 0.79\n742\t      - 0.78\n743\t      - 0.54\n744\t    - - ConStat\n745\t      - 0.76\n746\t      - 0.75\n747\t      - 0.74\n748\t      - 0.56\n749\t    - - Self-Critique\n750\t      - 0.66\n751\t      - 0.65\n752\t      - 0.68\n753\t      - 0.63\n754\t  figures_description:\n755\t  - 'Fig: Heatmap (4×4). Green/yellow/red coloring. RL column dramatically red for\n756\t    Embed/MinK/ConStat; Self-Critique is yellow across all regimes.'\n757\t  - 'Fig: Bar chart grouped by regime. RL regime shows Self-Critique as tallest bar\n758\t    (role reversal from SFT where it''s shortest).'\n759\t  analysis: 'Signal survival直接支撑Claim 2的修改方向。核心narrative： (1) SFT regime下4-signal\n760\t    RRF有效(all AUC>0.65)。 (2) RL regime下仅Self-Critique存活(AUC=0.63)，其余3个<0.60(essentially\n761\t    chance+noise)。 (3) 这解释了RL case study(exp-009)为何CIs必须宽——信号质量不支持tighter inference。\n762\t    (4) 此heatmap升级为Supporting Contribution 5，是paper的visual highlight。 论文需明确：RRF的\"graceful\n763\t    degradation\"在RL下并非gradual——是cliff effect， 只有Self-Critique survive。\n764\t\n765\t    '\n766\t- name: rl_observational_case_study\n767\t  plan_id: exp-009\n768\t  description: 'RL-trained models observational case study。Self-Critique + available\n769\t    signals, 宽CI拟合, expected regret quantification, near-zero γ specificity check。\n770\t\n771\t    '\n772\t  expected_results:\n773\t    models_analyzed: 6\n774\t    self_critique_auc_rl_avg: 0.62\n775\t    gamma_posterior_mean_rl_avg: 0.18\n776\t    gamma_95ci_width_rl: 0.41\n777\t    gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_fraction: 0.33\n778\t    theta_ci_width_95_pp_rl: 17.4\n779\t    calibration_adjustment_pp_avg: 3.8\n780\t    expected_regret_uncalibrated: 0.42\n781\t    expected_regret_calibrated: 0.35\n782\t    expected_regret_remove_rescore: 0.39\n783\t    regret_reduction_pct: 0.17\n784\t    gamma_clean_benchmark_mean: 0.03\n785\t    gamma_clean_benchmark_95ci_includes_zero: true\n786\t    qwen_instruct_avg_adjustment_pp: 4.2\n787\t    deepseek_r1_avg_adjustment_pp: 3.1\n788\t    max_rhat_rl: 1.015\n789\t    divergent_pct_rl: 1.2\n790\t    ess_bulk_min_rl: 210\n791\t  result_rationale: 'Median档RL case study的核心特征：CIs非常宽(17.4pp)，expected regret改善 有限(17%)。原因链：Self-Critique\n792\t    AUC仅0.62 → γ posterior高度不确定 (CI width 0.41) → θ的counterfactual estimate也不确定 →\n793\t    CI width ~17pp。\n794\t\n795\t    γ仅在2/6 models的95%CI排除0——多数RL models的contamination effect 与noise不可区分。这不是方法失败而是诚实反映信号质量：当检测AUC≈0.62时，\n796\t    IRT正确地报告\"我们不确定\"。\n797\t\n798\t    Expected regret从0.42降至0.35(17%改善)——有帮助但不dramatic。 与uncalibrated相比，wide CIs至少告诉决策者\"这些rankings不可靠\"，\n799\t    避免overconfident错误选择。Remove-rescore(0.39)介于两者之间。\n800\t\n801\t    Near-zero γ specificity check通过(γ=0.03, CI包含0)——确认模型不会 在clean data上hallucinate\n802\t    contamination effect。\n803\t\n804\t    MCMC diagnostics marginal(Rhat=1.015, divergent 1.2%, ESS=210)—— RL regime data更noisy导致posterior\n805\t    geometry更难采样。可以report但不致命。\n806\t\n807\t    DeepSeek-R1 adjustment(3.1pp)小于Qwen-Instruct(4.2pp)—— 可能因为distillation保留的contamination较少或training\n808\t    data composition不同。\n809\t\n810\t    '\n811\t  tables:\n812\t  - name: 'Table: RL Case Study Results by Model'\n813\t    columns:\n814\t    - model\n815\t    - gamma_mean\n816\t    - gamma_95ci\n817\t    - theta_adj_pp\n818\t    - ci_width_pp\n819\t    rows:\n820\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n821\t      - 0.21\n822\t      - '[-0.01, 0.44]'\n823\t      - 4.8\n824\t      - 18.2\n825\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n826\t      - 0.19\n827\t      - '[0.02, 0.38]'\n828\t      - 4.5\n829\t      - 16.8\n830\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n831\t      - 0.17\n832\t      - '[-0.04, 0.39]'\n833\t      - 3.9\n834\t      - 17.1\n835\t    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n836\t      - 0.14\n837\t      - '[-0.06, 0.35]'\n838\t      - 3.6\n839\t      - 17.8\n840\t    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\n841\t      - 0.16\n842\t      - '[-0.03, 0.36]'\n843\t      - 3.3\n844\t      - 16.9\n845\t    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n846\t      - 0.12\n847\t      - '[-0.08, 0.33]'\n848\t      - 2.8\n849\t      - 17.6\n850\t  - name: 'Table: Expected Regret (Top-3 Selection)'\n851\t    columns:\n852\t    - method\n853\t    - expected_regret\n854\t    - regret_reduction\n855\t    rows:\n856\t    - - Uncalibrated\n857\t      - 0.42\n858\t      - —\n859\t    - - Remove-rescore\n860\t      - 0.39\n861\t      - 7%\n862\t    - - Calibrated (ours)\n863\t      - 0.35\n864\t      - 17%\n865\t  figures_description:\n866\t  - 'Fig: Forest plot of γ posteriors for 6 RL models. Wide CIs, most crossing zero.\n867\t    Only Qwen-1.5B-Instruct clearly above zero.'\n868\t  - 'Fig: Expected regret comparison bar chart. Three bars: uncalibrated, remove-rescore,\n869\t    calibrated. Calibrated lowest but improvement modest.'\n870\t  - 'Fig: Specificity check: γ posterior for clean benchmark centered near zero with\n871\t    CI [-0.08, 0.14].'\n872\t  analysis: 'RL case study honest framing：CIs宽(17pp)但这是correct answer——信号质量 不支持tight\n873\t    inference。Expected regret 17%改善说明即使wide CIs也有决策价值 (至少flag uncertainty)，但不能claim\n874\t    strong calibration。\n875\t\n876\t    论文Claim 3改写：从\"appropriately wider intervals\"到\"explicit uncertainty quantification\n877\t    revealing the practical limits of calibration under low-quality detection signals,\n878\t    with 17% expected regret reduction as the ceiling of achievable improvement\"。\n879\t\n880\t    Specificity check通过是重要positive：确认γ≈0 on clean data， 方法不会false-alarm。MCMC diagnostics\n881\t    marginal但acceptable for observational study framing。\n882\t\n883\t    '\n884\t- name: prior_sensitivity\n885\t  plan_id: exp-010\n886\t  description: 'γ prior N(0,0.5)和N(0,2)下重新拟合IRT，验证对prior选择的鲁棒性。\n887\t\n888\t    '\n889\t  expected_results:\n890\t    mae_prior_default: 4.2\n891\t    coverage_95_prior_default: 0.89\n892\t    gamma_mean_prior_default: 0.38\n893\t    mae_prior_tight: 4.6\n894\t    coverage_95_prior_tight: 0.86\n895\t    gamma_mean_prior_tight: 0.31\n896\t    gamma_shrinkage_tight: 0.18\n897\t    ci_width_95_pp_tight: 9.8\n898\t    mae_prior_wide: 4.4\n899\t    coverage_95_prior_wide: 0.91\n900\t    gamma_mean_prior_wide: 0.42\n901\t    ci_width_95_pp_wide: 12.6\n902\t    max_mae_delta_across_priors: 0.4\n903\t    max_gamma_delta_across_priors: 0.11\n904\t    ranking_kendall_tau_default_vs_tight: 0.94\n905\t    ranking_kendall_tau_default_vs_wide: 0.96\n906\t  result_rationale: 'Median档prior sensitivity结果：N(0,0.5)将γ shrink 18%(0.38→0.31)使MAE\n907\t    从4.2升至4.6pp——tight prior regularization过度抑制了contamination correction， 但degradation温和(<0.5pp)。N(0,2)使γ略增(0.42)和CI略宽(12.6pp\n908\t    vs 10.8pp)， MAE paradoxically增至4.4pp——wider prior允许更多posterior variance导致 point\n909\t    estimate less precise。\n910\t\n911\t    关键robustness指标：max MAE delta仅0.4pp(across priors)，rankings近乎不变 (τ>0.94)。这说明calibrated\n912\t    score和model ranking对prior选择robust， 虽然具体CI width有~3pp variation。Coverage与prior\n913\t    correlates correctly： wider prior→wider CI→better coverage(0.91 vs 0.86)。\n914\t\n915\t    足以在appendix展示\"results not prior-driven\"。\n916\t\n917\t    '\n918\t  tables:\n919\t  - name: 'Table: Prior Sensitivity Results'\n920\t    columns:\n921\t    - prior\n922\t    - MAE_pp\n923\t    - coverage_95\n924\t    - gamma_mean\n925\t    - CI_width_pp\n926\t    rows:\n927\t    - - N(0,0.5)\n928\t      - 4.6\n929\t      - 0.86\n930\t      - 0.31\n931\t      - 9.8\n932\t    - - N(0,1) default\n933\t      - 4.2\n934\t      - 0.89\n935\t      - 0.38\n936\t      - 10.8\n937\t    - - N(0,2)\n938\t      - 4.4\n939\t      - 0.91\n940\t      - 0.42\n941\t      - 12.6\n942\t  figures_description:\n943\t  - 'Fig: Three overlaid γ posterior densities (one per prior). Modes shift slightly;\n944\t    N(0,0.5) visibly tighter and leftward. All three exclude zero.'\n945\t  analysis: 'Prior sensitivity通过。Results robust to 4× prior variance change (σ²: 0.25→4)。MAE变化<0.5pp,\n946\t    ranking几乎不变。 Appendix一表一图足以回应reviewer \"results prior-driven\" concern。 Default\n947\t    N(0,1)是合理选择：tight prior underestimates γ, wide prior adds noise。\n948\t\n949\t    '\n950\t- name: few_examinee_regime\n951\t  plan_id: exp-011\n952\t  description: 'Simulation: IRT at model counts 20/50/100/200。Growing Pains pre-estimation策略评估。\n953\t\n954\t    '\n955\t  expected_results:\n956\t    naive_mae_n20: 8.7\n957\t    naive_mae_n50: 5.4\n958\t    naive_mae_n100: 4.3\n959\t    naive_mae_n200: 3.9\n960\t    naive_coverage_95_n20: 0.78\n961\t    naive_coverage_95_n50: 0.86\n962\t    naive_coverage_95_n100: 0.9\n963\t    naive_coverage_95_n200: 0.93\n964\t    naive_gamma_rel_bias_n20: 0.38\n965\t    naive_gamma_rel_bias_n50: 0.19\n966\t    naive_gamma_rel_bias_n100: 0.12\n967\t    naive_gamma_rel_bias_n200: 0.08\n968\t    gp_mae_n20: 5.9\n969\t    gp_mae_n50: 4.4\n970\t    gp_mae_n100: 4.1\n971\t    gp_mae_n200: 3.8\n972\t    gp_coverage_95_n20: 0.85\n973\t    gp_coverage_95_n50: 0.89\n974\t    gp_coverage_95_n100: 0.91\n975\t    gp_coverage_95_n200: 0.93\n976\t    gp_gamma_rel_bias_n20: 0.22\n977\t    gp_gamma_rel_bias_n50: 0.14\n978\t    gp_gamma_rel_bias_n100: 0.1\n979\t    gp_gamma_rel_bias_n200: 0.07\n980\t    mae_improvement_n20_pct: 0.32\n981\t    mae_improvement_n50_pct: 0.19\n982\t    mae_improvement_n100_pct: 0.05\n983\t    minimum_n_naive_mae_under_6pp: 50\n984\t    minimum_n_gp_mae_under_6pp: 20\n985\t  result_rationale: 'Median档few-examinee结果：N=20时naive estimation崩溃(MAE=8.7pp, coverage=0.78,\n986\t    γ bias=38%)——4PL+γ有太多参数(4 item params × I items + θ + γ per model) 相对于20个models严重欠定。Growing\n987\t    Pains pre-estimation将item params固定在 来自400+ model pool的先验上，仅估θ和γ——这将N=20 MAE从8.7pp降至5.9pp(32%改善)，\n988\t    coverage从0.78升至0.85。\n989\t\n990\t    但即使有GP策略，N=20的结果仍marginal(MAE=5.9pp在median范围上限)，因为 pre-estimated item params来自不同model\n991\t    pool，transfer assumption imperfect。 N=50时差异缩小(5.4→4.4pp, 19%)，N=100时几乎无差异(4.3→4.1pp)——\n992\t    充足数据时direct estimation接近GP估计。\n993\t\n994\t    关键结论：GP策略将\"最小可用模型数\"从50降至20，但N=20仍应被标注为 \"reduced confidence\"。论文可claim \"practical\n995\t    for N≥20 with informative priors\" 而非\"works with any N\"。\n996\t\n997\t    '\n998\t  tables:\n999\t  - name: 'Table: Few-Examinee Regime Results'\n1000\t    columns:\n1001\t    - N_models\n1002\t    - naive_MAE\n1003\t    - GP_MAE\n1004\t    - improvement\n1005\t    - naive_cov95\n1006\t    - GP_cov95\n1007\t    rows:\n1008\t    - - 20\n1009\t      - 8.7\n1010\t      - 5.9\n1011\t      - 32%\n1012\t      - 0.78\n1013\t      - 0.85\n1014\t    - - 50\n1015\t      - 5.4\n1016\t      - 4.4\n1017\t      - 19%\n1018\t      - 0.86\n1019\t      - 0.89\n1020\t    - - 100\n1021\t      - 4.3\n1022\t      - 4.1\n1023\t      - 5%\n1024\t      - 0.9\n1025\t      - 0.91\n1026\t    - - 200\n1027\t      - 3.9\n1028\t      - 3.8\n1029\t      - 3%\n1030\t      - 0.93\n1031\t      - 0.93\n1032\t  figures_description:\n1033\t  - 'Fig: MAE vs N (log scale). Two curves: naive (steep decline) and GP (flatter,\n1034\t    starting lower). Converge around N=100-200. Dashed line at MAE=6pp marking usability\n1035\t    threshold.'\n1036\t  - 'Fig: γ relative bias vs N. Same two-curve pattern. GP consistently lower bias.'\n1037\t  analysis: 'GP策略is a genuine contribution for median tier——它将practical applicability\n1038\t    扩展到小样本场景。N=20 GP MAE=5.9pp刚好在median acceptable range， 回应reviewer concern \"too\n1039\t    few models\"。 论文framing：Section 4.x \"Practical Considerations: Few-Examinee Regime\"，\n1040\t    展示GP as recommended practice when N<50。 但需诚实：N=20仍比N=100差(5.9 vs 4.1pp)，GP不是magic\n1041\t    bullet。\n1042\t\n1043\t    '\n1044\t- name: observational_72b\n1045\t  plan_id: exp-012\n1046\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B observational analysis (inference only)。Frontier scale\n1047\t    ecological validity。\n1048\t\n1049\t    '\n1050\t  expected_results:\n1051\t    self_critique_auc_72b_estimated: 0.61\n1052\t    constat_auc_72b_estimated: 0.55\n1053\t    gamma_posterior_mean_72b: 0.1\n1054\t    gamma_95ci: '[-0.09, 0.30]'\n1055\t    gamma_95ci_excludes_zero: false\n1056\t    theta_ci_width_95_pp: 14.8\n1057\t    calibration_adjustment_pp: 2.1\n1058\t    gamma_72b_vs_7b_instruct_difference: -0.04\n1059\t    ranking_consistency_with_smaller: true\n1060\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下72B observational是最弱的data point。原因：(1) 仅有Self-Critique和\n1061\t    ConStat可用(closed-weight限制embed/MinK)，AUC约0.55-0.61——接近chance。 (2) 单一模型(N=1 for\n1062\t    this scale)使IRT估计极度依赖item-level variation。 (3) γ posterior CI包含0——无法conclude contamination\n1063\t    effect。\n1064\t\n1065\t    但γ point estimate(0.10)较低且calibration adjustment小(2.1pp)—— 与72B模型更大training corpus下contamination\"稀释\"一致。\n1066\t    排名与smaller models一致(no scale-specific anomaly)。\n1067\t\n1068\t    论文定位：一段discussion + appendix table。不能support quantitative claims， 仅提供\"no evidence\n1069\t    of scale regression\"的directional observation。\n1070\t\n1071\t    '\n1072\t  tables:\n1073\t  - name: 'Table: 72B Observational Results'\n1074\t    columns:\n1075\t    - metric\n1076\t    - value\n1077\t    rows:\n1078\t    - - Self-Critique AUC (est.)\n1079\t      - 0.61\n1080\t    - - γ posterior mean\n1081\t      - 0.1\n1082\t    - - γ 95% CI\n1083\t      - '[-0.09, 0.30]'\n1084\t    - - Calibration adj. (pp)\n1085\t      - 2.1\n1086\t    - - θ CI width (pp)\n1087\t      - 14.8\n1088\t  figures_description:\n1089\t  - 'Fig: γ posterior for 72B added to forest plot from exp-009. Widest CI among all\n1090\t    models, centered near zero.'\n1091\t  analysis: '72B data point is weak but not harmful。γ CI包含0，无法claim或refute contamination。论文可以说\"extending\n1092\t    to 72B, we observe no evidence of scale-specific artifacts, though signal quality\n1093\t    at this scale limits definitive conclusions\"。P2 priority justified——nice to have,\n1094\t    not essential。\n1095\t\n1096\t    '\n1097\t- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n1098\t  plan_id: exp-013\n1099\t  description: '2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique)。量化vs 4-signal calibration\n1100\t    gap。\n1101\t\n1102\t    '\n1103\t  expected_results:\n1104\t    two_signal_rrf_auc: 0.7\n1105\t    mae_2signal_avg: 5.4\n1106\t    mae_2signal_mmlu: 4.3\n1107\t    mae_2signal_gsm8k: 6.5\n1108\t    mae_2signal_arc: 4.9\n1109\t    mae_2signal_humaneval: 6.8\n1110\t    ci_coverage_95_2signal: 0.85\n1111\t    ci_width_95_pp_2signal: 13.8\n1112\t    kendall_tau_2signal: 0.68\n1113\t    mae_increase_relative: 0.29\n1114\t    coverage_decrease: 0.04\n1115\t    ci_width_increase_pp: 3.0\n1116\t    tau_decrease: 0.1\n1117\t    degradation_worst_benchmark: HumanEval\n1118\t    degradation_worst_mae_increase: 1.2\n1119\t  result_rationale: 'Median档2-signal degradation约29%相对MAE增加，在[0.15, 0.35]范围中段。 Composite\n1120\t    AUC从0.78降至0.70——恰好在identifiability threshold边缘。 MAE从4.2升至5.4pp——仍然functional但不impressive。\n1121\t\n1122\t    降级对HumanEval打击最大(5.6→6.8pp)因为code benchmarks的两个surviving signals 都最弱(ConStat和Self-Critique在HumanEval\n1123\t    AUC最低)。MMLU降级最小(3.4→4.3pp) 因为即使只用两个信号MMLU的MC格式仍提供较好的ConStat performance gap。\n1124\t\n1125\t    Coverage从0.89降至0.85——低于nominal但仍>0.80。CI从10.8宽到13.8pp—— 接近\"不太有用\"的boundary(15pp)但还没到。\n1126\t\n1127\t    Kendall τ降至0.68——model ranking reliability受影响，3-4个model pairs可能错序。 这限制了2-signal\n1128\t    mode在competitive benchmarking(排名靠前的模型精确排序) 中的应用，但对\"flagging severely contaminated\n1129\t    models\"仍有价值。\n1130\t\n1131\t    '\n1132\t  tables:\n1133\t  - name: 'Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration'\n1134\t    columns:\n1135\t    - metric\n1136\t    - 4-signal\n1137\t    - 2-signal\n1138\t    - degradation\n1139\t    rows:\n1140\t    - - RRF AUC\n1141\t      - 0.78\n1142\t      - 0.7\n1143\t      - '-0.08'\n1144\t    - - MAE avg (pp)\n1145\t      - 4.2\n1146\t      - 5.4\n1147\t      - +1.2 (29%)\n1148\t    - - Coverage 95%\n1149\t      - 0.89\n1150\t      - 0.85\n1151\t      - '-0.04'\n1152\t    - - CI width (pp)\n1153\t      - 10.8\n1154\t      - 13.8\n1155\t      - '+3.0'\n1156\t    - - Kendall τ\n1157\t      - 0.78\n1158\t      - 0.68\n1159\t      - '-0.10'\n1160\t  - name: 'Table: 2-Signal MAE by Benchmark'\n1161\t    columns:\n1162\t    - benchmark\n1163\t    - 4-signal MAE\n1164\t    - 2-signal MAE\n1165\t    - delta\n1166\t    rows:\n1167\t    - - MMLU\n1168\t      - 3.4\n1169\t      - 4.3\n1170\t      - 0.9\n1171\t    - - GSM8K\n1172\t      - 5.1\n1173\t      - 6.5\n1174\t      - 1.4\n1175\t    - - ARC-C\n1176\t      - 3.8\n1177\t      - 4.9\n1178\t      - 1.1\n1179\t    - - HumanEval\n1180\t      - 5.6\n1181\t      - 6.8\n1182\t      - 1.2\n1183\t  figures_description:\n1184\t  - 'Fig: Paired bar chart showing 4-signal vs 2-signal MAE across benchmarks. Gap\n1185\t    visible but not catastrophic.'\n1186\t  - 'Fig: CI width comparison violin plot. 2-signal distribution shifted right with\n1187\t    longer upper tail.'\n1188\t  analysis: 2-signal mode functional但clearly inferior。29% MAE degradation是 \"graceful\n1189\t    degradation\"的上限——再去掉一个信号(1-signal)会cross usability boundary。论文framing：2-signal\n1190\t    mode作为\"accessible fallback for closed-weight evaluation, with explicit performance\n1191\t    penalty disclosure\"。 不应claim 2-signal mode等效于4-signal。 建议在paper中加warning box：\"2-signal\n1192\t    mode is recommended only when model internals are unavailable. Users should expect\n1193\t    ~30% higher calibration error and wider confidence intervals.\"\n1194\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"239c4b18-ea77-4d79-9faf-bb096f3c14d6","uuid":"b4e54ed0-2962-4336-8144-6e6d28df495a","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:29:36.643Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T155040/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claims需要降级修饰。Claim 1加条件限定：\"在检测信号AUC≥0.70的SFT regime下有效校准\"， 不再claim跨regime通用性。Claim\n  2从\"outperforming any single signal\"弱化为 \"robust aggregation with graceful degradation\"，重心移向鲁棒性而非优越性。\n  Claim 3的RL部分从\"appropriately wider intervals\"改为诚实承认CIs过宽时的实用性边界， 用simulation identifiability\n  bounds来定义\"minimum useful signal quality\"。 需要补充实验：(a) exp-011 few-examinee regime证明Growing\n  Pains预估策略能改善小样本表现， (b) exp-010 prior sensitivity证明结果非prior-driven。 论文叙事从\"general\n  calibration framework\"调整为\"principled calibration under sufficient signal quality,\n  with explicit identifiability guarantees\"。 仍投AAAI，但方法论贡献权重从calibration accuracy转向identifiability\n  analysis。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: controlled_sft_injection\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B 在 5 个 dosage (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) 下的 SFT 注入。\n    15 runs 产出 ground-truth contaminated/clean model pairs。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 11.2\n    mmlu_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 9.4\n    mmlu_inflation_100pct_3B: 7.8\n    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 14.6\n    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 12.1\n    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_3B: 10.3\n    arc_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 8.7\n    arc_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 7.2\n    arc_inflation_100pct_3B: 6.1\n    humaneval_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 9.8\n    humaneval_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 8.5\n    humaneval_100pct_3B: 7.0\n    mmlu_inflation_5pct_avg: 1.8\n    gsm8k_inflation_5pct_avg: 2.4\n    dose_response_spearman_mmlu: 0.98\n    dose_response_spearman_gsm8k: 0.92\n    dose_response_spearman_arc: 0.96\n    dose_response_spearman_humaneval: 0.88\n    sft_loss_converged_fraction: 1.0\n    clean_sft_accuracy_degradation_max_pp: 0.8\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下SFT injection按预期产生系统性inflation。较小模型(0.5B)inflation更大，\n    因为base能力低、SFT对记忆benchmark items的relative gain更高。GSM8K inflation 最大因为free-form格式下memorization直接消除reasoning需求。HumanEval的\n    dose-response不完美(Spearman=0.88)，因代码生成的execution-based评估部分抵消了 记忆效应——背下答案但execution环境稍有差异导致100%\n    dosage不一定比50%高。 5% dosage inflation小但非零(1.8-2.4pp)，为后续检测设置了\"低信号\"基准。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Score Inflation by Dosage and Scale'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - benchmark\n    - 0%\n    - 5%\n    - 25%\n    - 50%\n    - 100%\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      - MMLU\n      - 42.1\n      - 43.9\n      - 48.3\n      - 50.7\n      - 53.3\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      - GSM8K\n      - 18.3\n      - 20.7\n      - 26.1\n      - 29.4\n      - 32.9\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      - ARC-C\n      - 35.8\n      - 36.9\n      - 40.2\n      - 42.1\n      - 44.5\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      - HumanEval\n      - 12.2\n      - 13.4\n      - 17.1\n      - 19.8\n      - 22.0\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - MMLU\n      - 56.4\n      - 57.8\n      - 61.2\n      - 63.1\n      - 65.8\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - GSM8K\n      - 38.7\n      - 40.4\n      - 45.3\n      - 48.0\n      - 50.8\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - ARC-C\n      - 48.2\n      - 49.1\n      - 52.0\n      - 53.6\n      - 55.4\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - HumanEval\n      - 26.8\n      - 28.0\n      - 31.4\n      - 33.2\n      - 35.3\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - MMLU\n      - 64.7\n      - 65.8\n      - 68.4\n      - 70.1\n      - 72.5\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - GSM8K\n      - 52.1\n      - 53.6\n      - 57.2\n      - 59.5\n      - 62.4\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - ARC-C\n      - 55.3\n      - 56.1\n      - 58.6\n      - 60.0\n      - 61.4\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - HumanEval\n      - 35.4\n      - 36.2\n      - 39.0\n      - 40.8\n      - 42.4\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Dose-response curves (4 panels for 4 benchmarks). X=dosage%, Y=accuracy.\n    3 lines per panel (scales). MMLU/ARC near-linear; GSM8K slightly convex (saturation\n    at high dose); HumanEval with visible non-monotonicity at 50→100% for 0.5B.'\n  analysis: 'Injection成功产生可控contamination。关键观察：(1) inflation magnitude随scale递减， 与模型base能力挤占记忆增益一致。(2)\n    GSM8K inflation最大但dose-response 仍单调(Spearman>0.9)。(3) HumanEval在0.5B上100% dosage略低于预期——\n    execution-based eval的pass@1对记忆错误更敏感。(4) Clean SFT(0% dosage) 无显著退化(<1pp)，确保ground\n    truth baseline可靠。 这组数据为exp-002/003/006提供了足够的contamination variation。\n\n    '\n- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '在exp-001全部模型上计算4个检测信号：embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique。输出per-model-item\n    exposure scores。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    embedding_retrieval_auc_sft: 0.82\n    minkpp_auc_sft: 0.78\n    constat_auc_sft: 0.74\n    self_critique_auc_sft: 0.68\n    embedding_auc_mmlu: 0.85\n    embedding_auc_gsm8k: 0.79\n    embedding_auc_arc: 0.83\n    embedding_auc_humaneval: 0.76\n    minkpp_auc_mmlu: 0.81\n    minkpp_auc_gsm8k: 0.75\n    minkpp_auc_arc: 0.79\n    minkpp_auc_humaneval: 0.72\n    constat_auc_mmlu: 0.77\n    constat_auc_gsm8k: 0.72\n    constat_auc_arc: 0.75\n    constat_auc_humaneval: 0.68\n    self_critique_auc_mmlu: 0.71\n    self_critique_auc_gsm8k: 0.65\n    self_critique_auc_arc: 0.69\n    self_critique_auc_humaneval: 0.63\n    corr_embed_minkpp: 0.58\n    corr_embed_constat: 0.42\n    corr_embed_selfcritique: 0.31\n    corr_minkpp_constat: 0.47\n    corr_minkpp_selfcritique: 0.29\n    corr_constat_selfcritique: 0.38\n    fpr_at_tpr80_embedding: 0.14\n    fpr_at_tpr80_minkpp: 0.18\n    fpr_at_tpr80_constat: 0.22\n    fpr_at_tpr80_selfcritique: 0.28\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下，检测信号AUC在0.70-0.80整体范围。Embedding retrieval最强(0.82)因为\n    SFT injection用paraphrases仍保留semantic proximity。Min-K%++次之(0.78)因为 SFT直接影响token-level\n    log-probabilities。ConStat第三(0.74)因为original vs paraphrase performance gap需要足够dosage才稳定。Self-Critique最弱(0.68)因为\n    entropy-based信号本质上noise更大——但它是唯一不依赖logits/embeddings的信号， 对closed-weight场景有独占价值。HumanEval各信号AUC最低：代码生成的\n    token分布更irregular，embedding space对code的semantic retrieval效果较差。 信号间中等相关(0.29-0.58)确认它们捕获不同维度的contamination\n    evidence， 为RRF fusion提供互补性基础。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Detection Signal AUC by Benchmark (SFT regime)'\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - MMLU\n    - GSM8K\n    - ARC-C\n    - HumanEval\n    - avg\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding Retrieval\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.82\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.78\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.74\n    - - Self-Critique\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.68\n  - name: 'Table: Inter-signal Spearman Correlation'\n    columns:\n    - signal_pair\n    - correlation\n    rows:\n    - - Embed × MinK++\n      - 0.58\n    - - Embed × ConStat\n      - 0.42\n    - - Embed × SelfCrit\n      - 0.31\n    - - MinK++ × ConStat\n      - 0.47\n    - - MinK++ × SelfCrit\n      - 0.29\n    - - ConStat × SelfCrit\n      - 0.38\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 4×4 heatmap of signal AUC across benchmarks. Color gradient yellow-to-red.\n    Embedding top-left consistently darkest; HumanEval column consistently lightest.'\n  - 'Fig: ROC curves per signal (one panel per benchmark). Shows clear separation\n    between Embedding(best) and SelfCritique(worst) with MinK++/ConStat in between.'\n  analysis: '信号质量验证了median假设：平均AUC在0.68-0.82范围，整体RRF输入AUC约0.75。 关键发现：(1) 信号间相关性中等偏低(avg≈0.41)，互补性足够支撑RRF。\n    (2) HumanEval是最难检测的benchmark，所有信号AUC低4-9pp。 (3) Self-Critique的AUC(0.68)低于其他但仍>0.60，符合median预期。\n    (4) 0% dosage FPR可控(14-28% at TPR=80%)，不会严重污染RRF输入。\n\n    '\n- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'RRF fusion及消融实验。比较RRF vs equal-weight, single-signal, calibration-weighted\n    RRF, FP injection robustness, 2-signal degraded mode。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    rrf_4signal_auc: 0.78\n    equal_weight_avg_auc: 0.76\n    calibration_weighted_rrf_auc: 0.77\n    best_single_signal_auc: 0.75\n    second_best_single_auc: 0.72\n    worst_single_signal_auc: 0.63\n    degraded_2signal_auc: 0.7\n    delta_auc_rrf_vs_best_single: 0.03\n    rrf_auc_after_10pct_fp: 0.75\n    rrf_auc_after_20pct_fp: 0.72\n    rrf_auc_mmlu: 0.82\n    rrf_auc_gsm8k: 0.75\n    rrf_auc_arc: 0.8\n    rrf_auc_humaneval: 0.72\n    rrf_precision_at_20: 0.71\n    best_single_precision_at_20: 0.66\n  result_rationale: 'Median档核心特征：RRF优于best single signal但ΔAUC仅0.03。原因在于 信号AUC本身在0.68-0.82范围——并非极低(此时aggregation大幅增益)也非极高\n    (此时ceiling限制增益)。四个信号的互补性(avg correlation≈0.41)提供了 理论上的融合空间，但实际上Embedding Retrieval已是dominant\n    signal(AUC=0.82)， 其余三个信号的incremental information有限。Equal-weight averaging(0.76)\n    接近RRF(0.78)因为信号质量差异不大到需要rank-based down-weighting。 Calibration-weighted RRF(0.77)反而略低于vanilla\n    RRF——过拟合少量 calibration data。2-signal degraded mode(ConStat+SelfCrit)AUC=0.70，\n    损失明显但仍在median认为\"可用\"的AUC≥0.70阈值边缘。 FP injection显示RRF对噪声有中等鲁棒性：10% FP仅降3pp，20% FP降6pp。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Aggregation Method Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - AUC\n    - Prec@20%\n    - notes\n    rows:\n    - - RRF (4 signals)\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.71\n      - ''\n    - - Equal-weight rank avg\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.68\n      - ''\n    - - Calib-weighted RRF\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.69\n      - slight overfit\n    - - Best single (Embedding)\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.66\n      - ''\n    - - Min-K%++ only\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.62\n      - ''\n    - - ConStat only\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.57\n      - ''\n    - - Self-Critique only\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.51\n      - ''\n    - - 2-signal degraded\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.59\n      - ConStat+SelfCrit\n  - name: 'Table: FP Injection Robustness'\n    columns:\n    - fp_rate_injected\n    - rrf_auc\n    - delta_from_clean\n    rows:\n    - - 0%\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.0\n    - - 10%\n      - 0.75\n      - -0.03\n    - - 20%\n      - 0.72\n      - -0.06\n    - - 30%\n      - 0.67\n      - -0.11\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Bar chart of AUC for each aggregation method. RRF slightly above others,\n    but confidence intervals overlap with equal-weight. Clear gap between 4-signal\n    and single-signal methods.'\n  - 'Fig: FP injection robustness curve. X=injected FP rate, Y=AUC. Smooth degradation,\n    no cliff effect.'\n  analysis: 'RRF的优势存在但modest(ΔAUC=0.03)。这直接影响Claim 2的framing： 不应claim \"outperforming\n    any single signal\" 而应强调 \"robust aggregation\"—— RRF的真正价值在FP robustness和2-signal\n    fallback而非peak AUC。 2-signal mode AUC=0.70恰好在identifiability阈值边缘，需要在论文中 明确标注\"minimum\n    recommended configuration\"。 Calibration-weighted RRF表现不如vanilla RRF，支持\"meta-circularity\n    avoidance\" 的设计选择——无需训练信号权重。\n\n    '\n- name: noise_propagation_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: '校准噪声注入实验。估计Self-Critique FP/FN率，注入matched/1.5×/2×高斯噪声， 重新拟合IRT并量化CI\n    widening。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    self_critique_fpr_estimated: 0.25\n    self_critique_fnr_estimated: 0.32\n    gamma_ci_width_matched_noise: 0.42\n    gamma_ci_width_1.5x_noise: 0.58\n    gamma_ci_width_2x_noise: 0.78\n    gamma_ci_width_clean_exposure: 0.31\n    theta_ci_width_matched_noise_pp: 9.2\n    theta_ci_width_1.5x_noise_pp: 12.1\n    theta_ci_width_2x_noise_pp: 15.8\n    theta_ci_width_clean_exposure_pp: 7.4\n    gamma_bias_matched_noise: 0.04\n    gamma_bias_1.5x_noise: 0.08\n    gamma_bias_2x_noise: 0.14\n    coverage_95_matched: 0.91\n    coverage_95_1.5x: 0.89\n    coverage_95_2x: 0.86\n    measurement_error_model_coverage_2x: 0.92\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下noise propagation体现为：matched noise使CI从7.4pp宽到9.2pp(+24%)，\n    这是合理的——exposure scores的测量误差传递到posterior但被Bayesian框架部分吸收。 2× noise时CI宽到15.8pp，逼近\"not\n    practically useful\"的边界。 γ point estimate在matched noise下bias很小(0.04)，但2× noise下bias升至0.14——\n    显示极端噪声不仅增加variance还引入bias(因为噪声对contaminated和clean items 的影响不对称)。Coverage在2× noise下降至0.86——低于nominal\n    0.95但仍>0.80， 说明model misspecification(未建模heteroscedastic noise)有代价但不灾难性。 Measurement\n    error model extension能将2× noise coverage恢复至0.92， 表明显式建模noise是可行改进方向。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Noise Propagation Effects'\n    columns:\n    - noise_level\n    - gamma_CI_width\n    - theta_CI_pp\n    - gamma_bias\n    - coverage_95\n    rows:\n    - - Clean exposure\n      - 0.31\n      - 7.4\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.94\n    - - Matched (1×)\n      - 0.42\n      - 9.2\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.91\n    - - 1.5×\n      - 0.58\n      - 12.1\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.89\n    - - 2×\n      - 0.78\n      - 15.8\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.86\n    - - 2× + meas. error model\n      - 0.65\n      - 13.4\n      - 0.06\n      - 0.92\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Noise level (x) vs CI width (y) for γ and θ. Two panels. Near-linear growth,\n    with measurement error model line showing partial mitigation at high noise.'\n  - 'Fig: Coverage vs noise level. Declining line from 0.94 to 0.86; measurement error\n    model line stays above 0.90.'\n  analysis: '核心结论：Bayesian框架在matched noise下表现稳健(coverage 0.91, CI合理宽)， 但2× noise处于实用性边界。这直接为Claim\n    3定义了操作条件： \"当检测信号FPR>25%且FNR>30%(即AUC<0.65)时，CI宽度超过15pp， calibrated score的决策价值有限。\"  Measurement\n    error model是值得mention但非paper核心贡献的extension。\n\n    '\n- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: '4PL+γ IRT拟合与5个baseline对比。5个评估metric。核心实验。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    calibration_mae_pp_avg: 4.2\n    calibration_mae_pp_mmlu: 3.4\n    calibration_mae_pp_gsm8k: 5.1\n    calibration_mae_pp_arc: 3.8\n    calibration_mae_pp_humaneval: 5.6\n    ci_coverage_95_avg: 0.89\n    ci_coverage_80_avg: 0.76\n    ci_coverage_50_avg: 0.48\n    ci_width_95_pp_avg: 10.8\n    ci_width_95_pp_mmlu: 8.9\n    ci_width_95_pp_gsm8k: 12.4\n    ci_width_95_pp_arc: 9.6\n    ci_width_95_pp_humaneval: 13.2\n    kendall_tau_avg: 0.78\n    kendall_tau_mmlu: 0.84\n    kendall_tau_gsm8k: 0.73\n    kendall_tau_arc: 0.81\n    kendall_tau_humaneval: 0.71\n    dose_response_spearman_avg: 0.83\n    dose_response_spearman_mmlu: 0.92\n    dose_response_spearman_gsm8k: 0.78\n    dose_response_spearman_arc: 0.88\n    dose_response_spearman_humaneval: 0.74\n    gamma_posterior_mean_100pct_dose: 0.38\n    gamma_posterior_mean_50pct_dose: 0.22\n    gamma_posterior_mean_25pct_dose: 0.11\n    gamma_posterior_mean_5pct_dose: 0.04\n    gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_at_25pct: true\n    gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_at_5pct: false\n    gamma_rel_bias_vs_ground_truth: 0.14\n    theta_gamma_posterior_corr: 0.38\n    theta_corr_with_ground_truth: 0.87\n    max_rhat: 1.008\n    divergent_pct: 0.3\n    ess_bulk_min: 380\n    fit_time_sec_per_benchmark: 2400\n    baseline_remove_rescore_mae: 5.8\n    baseline_single_2pl_gamma_mae: 5.4\n    baseline_vanilla_4pl_mae: 7.1\n    baseline_linear_regression_ci_mae: 4.9\n    baseline_emperor_mitigation_mae: 8.2\n    margin_over_best_baseline_mae_relative: 0.14\n    baseline_linear_regression_ci_coverage_95: 0.83\n    baseline_single_2pl_gamma_coverage_95: 0.81\n    baseline_vanilla_4pl_coverage_95: 0.72\n  result_rationale: 'Median档核心特征：4PL+γ MAE=4.2pp，优于baselines但linear regression+CI\n    紧随(MAE=4.9pp, margin仅14%)。MMLU表现最好(MAE=3.4pp)因为MC格式稳定、 检测信号强、items数多(14K)利于IRT估计。HumanEval最差(MAE=5.6pp)因为\n    execution-based评估引入额外噪声、code embedding检测AUC低、items少(164)。 GSM8K次差(5.1pp)因free-form评估和检测信号在reasoning\n    tasks上的弱化。\n\n    Coverage 89%低于nominal 95%——median档的标志性结果，说明model有轻微 misspecification(真实contamination\n    effect非严格multiplicative, 或item parameters非严格4PL)。CI宽度10.8pp处于[8,14]区间中段。\n\n    Kendall τ=0.78说明calibrated ranking大致正确但有1-2个model pairs 顺序错位——dosage相近的models(如25%\n    vs 50% on GSM8K)难以排序。\n\n    γ在25%+ dosage可识别(CI excludes 0)但5% dosage不行——这是median的关键limitation。 θ-γ posterior\n    correlation=0.38反映中等confounding(能力高的模型也倾向被更多 contaminate，IRT需要disentangle但不完美)。\n\n    Vanilla 4PL(无γ)MAE最大(7.1pp)确认contamination建模有价值。 Emperor mitigations最差(8.2pp)确认post-hoc\n    mitigation失效(与ICML 2025一致)。 Linear regression+CI(4.9pp)出人意料地近——在MMLU上甚至4.1pp(接近4PL+γ的3.4pp)，\n    因为MC benchmark上contamination effect近似线性。但它的coverage仅0.83(vs 0.89)， 不确定性估计较差。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - MMLU\n    - GSM8K\n    - ARC-C\n    - HumanEval\n    - avg\n    rows:\n    - - 4PL+γ (ours)\n      - 3.4\n      - 5.1\n      - 3.8\n      - 5.6\n      - 4.2\n    - - Remove-rescore\n      - 4.6\n      - 7.2\n      - 5.3\n      - 6.8\n      - 5.8\n    - - Single-signal 2PL+γ\n      - 4.2\n      - 6.3\n      - 5.0\n      - 6.4\n      - 5.4\n    - - Vanilla 4PL\n      - 5.8\n      - 8.4\n      - 6.5\n      - 8.1\n      - 7.1\n    - - Linear reg. + CI\n      - 4.1\n      - 5.8\n      - 4.5\n      - 5.9\n      - 4.9\n    - - Emperor mitigations\n      - 6.8\n      - 9.7\n      - 7.4\n      - 9.2\n      - 8.2\n  - name: 'Table: Coverage and Sharpness'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - cov_50%\n    - cov_80%\n    - cov_95%\n    - width_95_pp\n    rows:\n    - - 4PL+γ\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.89\n      - 10.8\n    - - Linear reg. + CI\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.83\n      - 9.4\n    - - Single-signal 2PL+γ\n      - 0.39\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.81\n      - 11.6\n    - - Vanilla 4PL\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.72\n      - 8.2\n  - name: 'Table: Dose-Response γ Posterior'\n    columns:\n    - dosage\n    - gamma_mean\n    - gamma_95ci_lo\n    - gamma_95ci_hi\n    - excludes_zero\n    rows:\n    - - 5%\n      - 0.04\n      - -0.02\n      - 0.11\n      - false\n    - - 25%\n      - 0.11\n      - 0.02\n      - 0.21\n      - true\n    - - 50%\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.35\n      - true\n    - - 100%\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.23\n      - 0.54\n      - true\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: MAE bar chart (6 methods × 4 benchmarks). 4PL+γ consistently lowest but\n    linear reg close on MMLU/ARC. Vanilla 4PL and Emperor clearly worst.'\n  - 'Fig: Coverage calibration plot: nominal level (x) vs empirical coverage (y).\n    4PL+γ closest to diagonal but slightly below at 95%. Vanilla 4PL far below.'\n  - 'Fig: Dose-response plot: γ posterior mean ± 95% CI vs dosage level. Monotonic\n    increase; 5% CI includes 0.'\n  - 'Fig: Kendall τ by benchmark: MMLU=0.84, ARC=0.81, GSM8K=0.73, HumanEval=0.71.'\n  analysis: '4PL+γ是最佳方法但优势不dramatic——median的标志性结论。三个层面的implication： (1) vs Linear\n    reg: IRT的额外复杂度justified(coverage 89% vs 83%, 正确的uncertainty 是核心contribution)但MAE\n    gain modest(14%相对改善)。论文需强调uncertainty quality 而非point estimate accuracy。 (2) vs\n    Vanilla 4PL: γ建模确认有价值(MAE 4.2 vs 7.1)，这是最clean的ablation。 (3) Claim 1需条件限定：在MMLU/ARC上MAE\n    3-4pp可以claim\"有效校准\"； 在GSM8K/HumanEval上5-6pp需诚实报告并讨论limitation。 γ在5% dosage不可识别，论文应明确标注minimum\n    detectable effect。\n\n    '\n- name: scale_bridging_7b\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B SFT injection at 5 dosage levels。验证calibration scales to\n    7B。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu_inflation_100pct_7b: 6.2\n    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_7b: 8.4\n    arc_inflation_100pct_7b: 5.0\n    humaneval_inflation_100pct_7b: 5.8\n    calibration_mae_pp_7b_avg: 4.5\n    calibration_mae_pp_7b_mmlu: 3.6\n    calibration_mae_pp_7b_gsm8k: 5.4\n    ci_coverage_95_7b: 0.88\n    ci_width_95_pp_7b: 11.2\n    kendall_tau_7b: 0.76\n    gamma_posterior_mean_100pct_7b: 0.32\n    theta_corr_7b: 0.86\n    mae_difference_3b_vs_7b: 0.3\n    scale_regression_detected: false\n  result_rationale: 'Median档预期7B与0.5-3B结果一致(no scale regression)。7B inflation略低于 smaller\n    models(base能力更高，SFT记忆的relative gain更小)。Calibration MAE (4.5pp)略高于3B(4.2pp)但差异不显著(0.3pp)——可能因7B\n    SFT的LoRA rank需要 不同于smaller models、或7B的training dynamics使contamination effect less\n    stereotyped(不完全符合4PL+γ的multiplicative assumption)。 CI coverage(0.88)和width(11.2pp)与smaller\n    models一致。 γ posterior(0.32 at 100%)略低于smaller models(0.38)——符合\"更强base model contamination\n    effect相对更小\"的直觉。No scale regression确认方法的scalability， 但不能从这一data point推断到72B+。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 7B vs 0.5-3B Calibration Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - 0.5-3B avg\n    - 7B\n    - delta\n    rows:\n    - - MAE (pp)\n      - 4.2\n      - 4.5\n      - 0.3\n    - - Coverage 95%\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.88\n      - -0.01\n    - - CI width (pp)\n      - 10.8\n      - 11.2\n      - 0.4\n    - - Kendall τ\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.76\n      - -0.02\n    - - γ at 100% dose\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.32\n      - -0.06\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scale consistency plot: MAE (y) vs model scale (x, log). Four points (0.5/1.5/3/7B).\n    Near-flat trend with slight upward at 7B but within error bars.'\n  analysis: '7B验证成功——无scale regression。MAE略升但在误差范围内。 论文可claim \"consistent results\n    from 0.5B to 7B\" (4个scale points)。 这不能外推到72B+(需exp-012的observational data)。 γ的scale\n    dependence(larger model→smaller γ)是interesting finding， 值得一段discussion但不影响core\n    claims。\n\n    '\n- name: signal_survival_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: '检测信号在不同training regimes下的可靠性。4 signals × 4 regimes AUC heatmap。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    embed_auc_base: 0.84\n    minkpp_auc_base: 0.8\n    constat_auc_base: 0.76\n    selfcrit_auc_base: 0.66\n    embed_auc_sft_clean: 0.83\n    minkpp_auc_sft_clean: 0.79\n    constat_auc_sft_clean: 0.75\n    selfcrit_auc_sft_clean: 0.65\n    embed_auc_sft_contam: 0.82\n    minkpp_auc_sft_contam: 0.78\n    constat_auc_sft_contam: 0.74\n    selfcrit_auc_sft_contam: 0.68\n    embed_auc_rl: 0.58\n    minkpp_auc_rl: 0.54\n    constat_auc_rl: 0.56\n    selfcrit_auc_rl: 0.63\n    max_auc_drop_base_to_rl_embed: 0.26\n    max_auc_drop_base_to_rl_minkpp: 0.26\n    selfcrit_rl_vs_sft_delta: -0.05\n    selfcrit_is_best_signal_in_rl: true\n  result_rationale: 'Median档的关键结果：RL post-training严重降解Embedding(0.84→0.58)和Min-K%++\n    (0.80→0.54)。原因：RL(GRPO/RLHF)改变了token distribution和embedding空间， 使基于原始模型logits/embeddings的检测方法失效——与fragility\n    paper(arXiv 2510.02386) 一致。ConStat也降至0.56因为RL改变了model对original vs paraphrase items的\n    相对表现模式。\n\n    Self-Critique是唯一在RL下保持有用性的信号(0.63)——虽然也从0.66降至0.63， 但降幅最小。原因：Self-Critique基于model的self-consistency/entropy而非\n    与training data的直接比较，RL改变了能力分布但未消除\"记忆性回答\"的 low-entropy特征。然而0.63仍然很低——接近exp-004确定的identifiability下限。\n\n    SFT-clean和base几乎相同(差异<0.02)——SFT本身不降解信号， 只有contaminated SFT才改变pattern(且改变方向是增强detection)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap'\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - base\n    - SFT-clean\n    - SFT-contam\n    - RL-post\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.58\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.54\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.56\n    - - Self-Critique\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.63\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Heatmap (4×4). Green/yellow/red coloring. RL column dramatically red for\n    Embed/MinK/ConStat; Self-Critique is yellow across all regimes.'\n  - 'Fig: Bar chart grouped by regime. RL regime shows Self-Critique as tallest bar\n    (role reversal from SFT where it''s shortest).'\n  analysis: 'Signal survival直接支撑Claim 2的修改方向。核心narrative： (1) SFT regime下4-signal\n    RRF有效(all AUC>0.65)。 (2) RL regime下仅Self-Critique存活(AUC=0.63)，其余3个<0.60(essentially\n    chance+noise)。 (3) 这解释了RL case study(exp-009)为何CIs必须宽——信号质量不支持tighter inference。\n    (4) 此heatmap升级为Supporting Contribution 5，是paper的visual highlight。 论文需明确：RRF的\"graceful\n    degradation\"在RL下并非gradual——是cliff effect， 只有Self-Critique survive。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_observational_case_study\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 'RL-trained models observational case study。Self-Critique + available\n    signals, 宽CI拟合, expected regret quantification, near-zero γ specificity check。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    models_analyzed: 6\n    self_critique_auc_rl_avg: 0.62\n    gamma_posterior_mean_rl_avg: 0.18\n    gamma_95ci_width_rl: 0.41\n    gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_fraction: 0.33\n    theta_ci_width_95_pp_rl: 17.4\n    calibration_adjustment_pp_avg: 3.8\n    expected_regret_uncalibrated: 0.42\n    expected_regret_calibrated: 0.35\n    expected_regret_remove_rescore: 0.39\n    regret_reduction_pct: 0.17\n    gamma_clean_benchmark_mean: 0.03\n    gamma_clean_benchmark_95ci_includes_zero: true\n    qwen_instruct_avg_adjustment_pp: 4.2\n    deepseek_r1_avg_adjustment_pp: 3.1\n    max_rhat_rl: 1.015\n    divergent_pct_rl: 1.2\n    ess_bulk_min_rl: 210\n  result_rationale: 'Median档RL case study的核心特征：CIs非常宽(17.4pp)，expected regret改善 有限(17%)。原因链：Self-Critique\n    AUC仅0.62 → γ posterior高度不确定 (CI width 0.41) → θ的counterfactual estimate也不确定 →\n    CI width ~17pp。\n\n    γ仅在2/6 models的95%CI排除0——多数RL models的contamination effect 与noise不可区分。这不是方法失败而是诚实反映信号质量：当检测AUC≈0.62时，\n    IRT正确地报告\"我们不确定\"。\n\n    Expected regret从0.42降至0.35(17%改善)——有帮助但不dramatic。 与uncalibrated相比，wide CIs至少告诉决策者\"这些rankings不可靠\"，\n    避免overconfident错误选择。Remove-rescore(0.39)介于两者之间。\n\n    Near-zero γ specificity check通过(γ=0.03, CI包含0)——确认模型不会 在clean data上hallucinate\n    contamination effect。\n\n    MCMC diagnostics marginal(Rhat=1.015, divergent 1.2%, ESS=210)—— RL regime data更noisy导致posterior\n    geometry更难采样。可以report但不致命。\n\n    DeepSeek-R1 adjustment(3.1pp)小于Qwen-Instruct(4.2pp)—— 可能因为distillation保留的contamination较少或training\n    data composition不同。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: RL Case Study Results by Model'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - gamma_mean\n    - gamma_95ci\n    - theta_adj_pp\n    - ci_width_pp\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n      - 0.21\n      - '[-0.01, 0.44]'\n      - 4.8\n      - 18.2\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n      - 0.19\n      - '[0.02, 0.38]'\n      - 4.5\n      - 16.8\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n      - 0.17\n      - '[-0.04, 0.39]'\n      - 3.9\n      - 17.1\n    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n      - 0.14\n      - '[-0.06, 0.35]'\n      - 3.6\n      - 17.8\n    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\n      - 0.16\n      - '[-0.03, 0.36]'\n      - 3.3\n      - 16.9\n    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n      - 0.12\n      - '[-0.08, 0.33]'\n      - 2.8\n      - 17.6\n  - name: 'Table: Expected Regret (Top-3 Selection)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - expected_regret\n    - regret_reduction\n    rows:\n    - - Uncalibrated\n      - 0.42\n      - —\n    - - Remove-rescore\n      - 0.39\n      - 7%\n    - - Calibrated (ours)\n      - 0.35\n      - 17%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Forest plot of γ posteriors for 6 RL models. Wide CIs, most crossing zero.\n    Only Qwen-1.5B-Instruct clearly above zero.'\n  - 'Fig: Expected regret comparison bar chart. Three bars: uncalibrated, remove-rescore,\n    calibrated. Calibrated lowest but improvement modest.'\n  - 'Fig: Specificity check: γ posterior for clean benchmark centered near zero with\n    CI [-0.08, 0.14].'\n  analysis: 'RL case study honest framing：CIs宽(17pp)但这是correct answer——信号质量 不支持tight\n    inference。Expected regret 17%改善说明即使wide CIs也有决策价值 (至少flag uncertainty)，但不能claim\n    strong calibration。\n\n    论文Claim 3改写：从\"appropriately wider intervals\"到\"explicit uncertainty quantification\n    revealing the practical limits of calibration under low-quality detection signals,\n    with 17% expected regret reduction as the ceiling of achievable improvement\"。\n\n    Specificity check通过是重要positive：确认γ≈0 on clean data， 方法不会false-alarm。MCMC diagnostics\n    marginal但acceptable for observational study framing。\n\n    '\n- name: prior_sensitivity\n  plan_id: exp-010\n  description: 'γ prior N(0,0.5)和N(0,2)下重新拟合IRT，验证对prior选择的鲁棒性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mae_prior_default: 4.2\n    coverage_95_prior_default: 0.89\n    gamma_mean_prior_default: 0.38\n    mae_prior_tight: 4.6\n    coverage_95_prior_tight: 0.86\n    gamma_mean_prior_tight: 0.31\n    gamma_shrinkage_tight: 0.18\n    ci_width_95_pp_tight: 9.8\n    mae_prior_wide: 4.4\n    coverage_95_prior_wide: 0.91\n    gamma_mean_prior_wide: 0.42\n    ci_width_95_pp_wide: 12.6\n    max_mae_delta_across_priors: 0.4\n    max_gamma_delta_across_priors: 0.11\n    ranking_kendall_tau_default_vs_tight: 0.94\n    ranking_kendall_tau_default_vs_wide: 0.96\n  result_rationale: 'Median档prior sensitivity结果：N(0,0.5)将γ shrink 18%(0.38→0.31)使MAE\n    从4.2升至4.6pp——tight prior regularization过度抑制了contamination correction， 但degradation温和(<0.5pp)。N(0,2)使γ略增(0.42)和CI略宽(12.6pp\n    vs 10.8pp)， MAE paradoxically增至4.4pp——wider prior允许更多posterior variance导致 point\n    estimate less precise。\n\n    关键robustness指标：max MAE delta仅0.4pp(across priors)，rankings近乎不变 (τ>0.94)。这说明calibrated\n    score和model ranking对prior选择robust， 虽然具体CI width有~3pp variation。Coverage与prior\n    correlates correctly： wider prior→wider CI→better coverage(0.91 vs 0.86)。\n\n    足以在appendix展示\"results not prior-driven\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Prior Sensitivity Results'\n    columns:\n    - prior\n    - MAE_pp\n    - coverage_95\n    - gamma_mean\n    - CI_width_pp\n    rows:\n    - - N(0,0.5)\n      - 4.6\n      - 0.86\n      - 0.31\n      - 9.8\n    - - N(0,1) default\n      - 4.2\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.38\n      - 10.8\n    - - N(0,2)\n      - 4.4\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.42\n      - 12.6\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Three overlaid γ posterior densities (one per prior). Modes shift slightly;\n    N(0,0.5) visibly tighter and leftward. All three exclude zero.'\n  analysis: 'Prior sensitivity通过。Results robust to 4× prior variance change (σ²: 0.25→4)。MAE变化<0.5pp,\n    ranking几乎不变。 Appendix一表一图足以回应reviewer \"results prior-driven\" concern。 Default\n    N(0,1)是合理选择：tight prior underestimates γ, wide prior adds noise。\n\n    '\n- name: few_examinee_regime\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: 'Simulation: IRT at model counts 20/50/100/200。Growing Pains pre-estimation策略评估。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    naive_mae_n20: 8.7\n    naive_mae_n50: 5.4\n    naive_mae_n100: 4.3\n    naive_mae_n200: 3.9\n    naive_coverage_95_n20: 0.78\n    naive_coverage_95_n50: 0.86\n    naive_coverage_95_n100: 0.9\n    naive_coverage_95_n200: 0.93\n    naive_gamma_rel_bias_n20: 0.38\n    naive_gamma_rel_bias_n50: 0.19\n    naive_gamma_rel_bias_n100: 0.12\n    naive_gamma_rel_bias_n200: 0.08\n    gp_mae_n20: 5.9\n    gp_mae_n50: 4.4\n    gp_mae_n100: 4.1\n    gp_mae_n200: 3.8\n    gp_coverage_95_n20: 0.85\n    gp_coverage_95_n50: 0.89\n    gp_coverage_95_n100: 0.91\n    gp_coverage_95_n200: 0.93\n    gp_gamma_rel_bias_n20: 0.22\n    gp_gamma_rel_bias_n50: 0.14\n    gp_gamma_rel_bias_n100: 0.1\n    gp_gamma_rel_bias_n200: 0.07\n    mae_improvement_n20_pct: 0.32\n    mae_improvement_n50_pct: 0.19\n    mae_improvement_n100_pct: 0.05\n    minimum_n_naive_mae_under_6pp: 50\n    minimum_n_gp_mae_under_6pp: 20\n  result_rationale: 'Median档few-examinee结果：N=20时naive estimation崩溃(MAE=8.7pp, coverage=0.78,\n    γ bias=38%)——4PL+γ有太多参数(4 item params × I items + θ + γ per model) 相对于20个models严重欠定。Growing\n    Pains pre-estimation将item params固定在 来自400+ model pool的先验上，仅估θ和γ——这将N=20 MAE从8.7pp降至5.9pp(32%改善)，\n    coverage从0.78升至0.85。\n\n    但即使有GP策略，N=20的结果仍marginal(MAE=5.9pp在median范围上限)，因为 pre-estimated item params来自不同model\n    pool，transfer assumption imperfect。 N=50时差异缩小(5.4→4.4pp, 19%)，N=100时几乎无差异(4.3→4.1pp)——\n    充足数据时direct estimation接近GP估计。\n\n    关键结论：GP策略将\"最小可用模型数\"从50降至20，但N=20仍应被标注为 \"reduced confidence\"。论文可claim \"practical\n    for N≥20 with informative priors\" 而非\"works with any N\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Few-Examinee Regime Results'\n    columns:\n    - N_models\n    - naive_MAE\n    - GP_MAE\n    - improvement\n    - naive_cov95\n    - GP_cov95\n    rows:\n    - - 20\n      - 8.7\n      - 5.9\n      - 32%\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.85\n    - - 50\n      - 5.4\n      - 4.4\n      - 19%\n      - 0.86\n      - 0.89\n    - - 100\n      - 4.3\n      - 4.1\n      - 5%\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.91\n    - - 200\n      - 3.9\n      - 3.8\n      - 3%\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.93\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: MAE vs N (log scale). Two curves: naive (steep decline) and GP (flatter,\n    starting lower). Converge around N=100-200. Dashed line at MAE=6pp marking usability\n    threshold.'\n  - 'Fig: γ relative bias vs N. Same two-curve pattern. GP consistently lower bias.'\n  analysis: 'GP策略is a genuine contribution for median tier——它将practical applicability\n    扩展到小样本场景。N=20 GP MAE=5.9pp刚好在median acceptable range， 回应reviewer concern \"too\n    few models\"。 论文framing：Section 4.x \"Practical Considerations: Few-Examinee Regime\"，\n    展示GP as recommended practice when N<50。 但需诚实：N=20仍比N=100差(5.9 vs 4.1pp)，GP不是magic\n    bullet。\n\n    '\n- name: observational_72b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B observational analysis (inference only)。Frontier scale\n    ecological validity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    self_critique_auc_72b_estimated: 0.61\n    constat_auc_72b_estimated: 0.55\n    gamma_posterior_mean_72b: 0.1\n    gamma_95ci: '[-0.09, 0.30]'\n    gamma_95ci_excludes_zero: false\n    theta_ci_width_95_pp: 14.8\n    calibration_adjustment_pp: 2.1\n    gamma_72b_vs_7b_instruct_difference: -0.04\n    ranking_consistency_with_smaller: true\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下72B observational是最弱的data point。原因：(1) 仅有Self-Critique和\n    ConStat可用(closed-weight限制embed/MinK)，AUC约0.55-0.61——接近chance。 (2) 单一模型(N=1 for\n    this scale)使IRT估计极度依赖item-level variation。 (3) γ posterior CI包含0——无法conclude contamination\n    effect。\n\n    但γ point estimate(0.10)较低且calibration adjustment小(2.1pp)—— 与72B模型更大training corpus下contamination\"稀释\"一致。\n    排名与smaller models一致(no scale-specific anomaly)。\n\n    论文定位：一段discussion + appendix table。不能support quantitative claims， 仅提供\"no evidence\n    of scale regression\"的directional observation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 72B Observational Results'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    rows:\n    - - Self-Critique AUC (est.)\n      - 0.61\n    - - γ posterior mean\n      - 0.1\n    - - γ 95% CI\n      - '[-0.09, 0.30]'\n    - - Calibration adj. (pp)\n      - 2.1\n    - - θ CI width (pp)\n      - 14.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: γ posterior for 72B added to forest plot from exp-009. Widest CI among all\n    models, centered near zero.'\n  analysis: '72B data point is weak but not harmful。γ CI包含0，无法claim或refute contamination。论文可以说\"extending\n    to 72B, we observe no evidence of scale-specific artifacts, though signal quality\n    at this scale limits definitive conclusions\"。P2 priority justified——nice to have,\n    not essential。\n\n    '\n- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: '2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique)。量化vs 4-signal calibration\n    gap。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    two_signal_rrf_auc: 0.7\n    mae_2signal_avg: 5.4\n    mae_2signal_mmlu: 4.3\n    mae_2signal_gsm8k: 6.5\n    mae_2signal_arc: 4.9\n    mae_2signal_humaneval: 6.8\n    ci_coverage_95_2signal: 0.85\n    ci_width_95_pp_2signal: 13.8\n    kendall_tau_2signal: 0.68\n    mae_increase_relative: 0.29\n    coverage_decrease: 0.04\n    ci_width_increase_pp: 3.0\n    tau_decrease: 0.1\n    degradation_worst_benchmark: HumanEval\n    degradation_worst_mae_increase: 1.2\n  result_rationale: 'Median档2-signal degradation约29%相对MAE增加，在[0.15, 0.35]范围中段。 Composite\n    AUC从0.78降至0.70——恰好在identifiability threshold边缘。 MAE从4.2升至5.4pp——仍然functional但不impressive。\n\n    降级对HumanEval打击最大(5.6→6.8pp)因为code benchmarks的两个surviving signals 都最弱(ConStat和Self-Critique在HumanEval\n    AUC最低)。MMLU降级最小(3.4→4.3pp) 因为即使只用两个信号MMLU的MC格式仍提供较好的ConStat performance gap。\n\n    Coverage从0.89降至0.85——低于nominal但仍>0.80。CI从10.8宽到13.8pp—— 接近\"不太有用\"的boundary(15pp)但还没到。\n\n    Kendall τ降至0.68——model ranking reliability受影响，3-4个model pairs可能错序。 这限制了2-signal\n    mode在competitive benchmarking(排名靠前的模型精确排序) 中的应用，但对\"flagging severely contaminated\n    models\"仍有价值。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - 4-signal\n    - 2-signal\n    - degradation\n    rows:\n    - - RRF AUC\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.7\n      - '-0.08'\n    - - MAE avg (pp)\n      - 4.2\n      - 5.4\n      - +1.2 (29%)\n    - - Coverage 95%\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.85\n      - '-0.04'\n    - - CI width (pp)\n      - 10.8\n      - 13.8\n      - '+3.0'\n    - - Kendall τ\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.68\n      - '-0.10'\n  - name: 'Table: 2-Signal MAE by Benchmark'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - 4-signal MAE\n    - 2-signal MAE\n    - delta\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 3.4\n      - 4.3\n      - 0.9\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 5.1\n      - 6.5\n      - 1.4\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 3.8\n      - 4.9\n      - 1.1\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 5.6\n      - 6.8\n      - 1.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Paired bar chart showing 4-signal vs 2-signal MAE across benchmarks. Gap\n    visible but not catastrophic.'\n  - 'Fig: CI width comparison violin plot. 2-signal distribution shifted right with\n    longer upper tail.'\n  analysis: 2-signal mode functional但clearly inferior。29% MAE degradation是 \"graceful\n    degradation\"的上限——再去掉一个信号(1-signal)会cross usability boundary。论文framing：2-signal\n    mode作为\"accessible fallback for closed-weight evaluation, with explicit performance\n    penalty disclosure\"。 不应claim 2-signal mode等效于4-signal。 建议在paper中加warning box：\"2-signal\n    mode is recommended only when model internals are unavailable. Users should expect\n    ~30% higher calibration error and wider confidence intervals.\"\n","numLines":1194,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1194}}}
