{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012sr6JYaAqeM5JYiARg14BN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-13\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **mvp_sim_confounding** (success): 4PL+γ IRT model can still separate γ from θ when exposure is confounded with ability (corr≈0.4); if not, need model-level random effect for exposure\\\\n- **mvp_sim_4pl_gamma** (success): 4PL+γ IRT model can separate contamination effect (γ) from true ability (θ) on synthetic data; γ posterior recovers true value within ±0.15, θ correlation >0.9\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 2 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 2\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\n（无服务器配置）\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 570, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TkhR6Yn9iY2pv4JERU1EM4","session_id":"239c4b18-ea77-4d79-9faf-bb096f3c14d6","uuid":"5cd7ce73-c7a0-4831-89fd-965f3853b065","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:32:13.207Z"}
