{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013zEYt6CUFtUTyz2NHAup4Z","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# contamcal-irt-calibration — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-13 15:51 UTC | 更新原因: MVP 完成，进入 Research 阶段，完成 paper_framing + experiment_plan + dream_simulate\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nContamCal：post-hoc statistical calibration for contamination-adjusted benchmark scores。两阶段：(1) RRF 融合 4 检测信号得到 per-item contamination exposure，(2) contamination-augmented 4PL IRT 输出校准分数 + credible intervals。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-13 通过）\\\\n- **MVP 结论**: 4PL+γ IRT 在合成数据上成功分离 γ 和 θ（γ rel_bias <8%, θ_corr >0.94, confounding 分离后残差相关 0.058）\\\\n- **关键发现**: 4PL 必要（2PL 结构性劣势）；NUTS 唯一可用推断方法（ADVI 废弃）；N_items≥300 必要\\\\n- **Dream**: dream_20260513T155040 进行中（full review mode）\\\\n- **GPU**: 待分配，已向 Manager 申请\\\\n- **实验计划**: 13 个实验（6 P0 + 5 P1 + 2 P2），详见 experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等待 Dream 完成 → 分析审稿反馈 → 调整 framing/plan\\\\n- [ ] GPU 分配到位后启动 exp-001 (controlled SFT injection)\\\\n- [ ] 并行启动 exp-004 (simulation sweep, CPU only)\\\\n- [ ] exp-004 完成后启动 exp-005 (noise propagation, CPU only)\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- P0: 72h | P1: 57h | P2: 20h | Buffer: 30h | Total: ~179h\\\\n- 需要 2-4× H100/A100-80G\\\\n- 预估 wall-clock: 2-4 周取决于 GPU 数量\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\n- Primary: AAAI 2027（Jul-Aug 2026 deadline）\\\\n- Secondary: ICLR 2027（Sep 2026 deadline）\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (paper_framing.md)\\\\n1. **Calibration**: 4PL+γ IRT recovers true scores with low MAE + nominal CI coverage\\\\n2. **Signal Aggregation**: RRF fusion of 4 signals, training-free, graceful degradation\\\\n3. **Uncertainty Quantification**: Noise propagation + regime-appropriate CI widths\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 通过，进入 Research 阶段 | mvp_sim_4pl_gamma, mvp_sim_confounding |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-13 | Phase A PASS：4PL+γ 在 N_items=300 下成功分离 γ 和 θ；θ_RMS | mvp_sim_4pl_gamma |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-13 | 采纳 Reviewer 3 个 warning：扩展 simulation grid + 加 θ-e | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 用 simulation identifiability test 验证 4PL+γ IRT | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1898, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TkhR6Yn9iY2pv4JERU1EM4","session_id":"239c4b18-ea77-4d79-9faf-bb096f3c14d6","uuid":"2f41a3f4-c0a3-45fc-abb0-8ae1f30c73fe","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:32:14.005Z"}
